BwAAAAWBBwAAAAIBQIAAAAAAgAAPQQwBDwEIABABDUEMwQ4BD4EPQQwBCAAPQQ1BD4EQQQ\\/BD4EQAQ4BDwESwQ1BCAAMQQ7BDAEMwQwBCAAMgQgADIEOAQ0BDUEIAA\\/BD4EMgRLBEgENQQ9BDgETwQgAEMEQAQ+BDIEPQRPBCAANgQ4BDcEPQQ4BCwAIAA\\/BEAEOARCBD4EOgQwBCAAOAQ9BDIENQRBBEIEOARGBDgEOQQgADgEIABDBDoEQAQ1BD8EOwQ1BD0EOARPBCAAQgQ+BEAEMwQ+BDIEOwQ4BC4AIAAeBDQEPQQwBDoEPgQgAE0EQgQ+BEIEIAA\\\\\\\\\\\\/BDUEQAQ4BD4ENAQ+BDwEIAA\\/BD4EQQRCBDUEPwQ1BD0EPQQ+BDkEIABBBDwENQQ9BEsEIAA\\/BDAEQAQwBDQEOAQzBDwESwQgADIEIAAyBD4EQQQ\\/BEAEOARPBEIEOAQ4BCAAQQQ\\/BD4EQQQ+BDEEPgQyBCAAQAQ1BEgENQQ9BDgETwQgAE0EOgQ+BDsEPgQzBDgERwQ1BEEEOgQ4BEUEIAA\\/BEAEPgQxBDsENQQ8BCAAMgQgAEEEQgRABDAEPQQwBEUEIAAmBDUEPQRCBEAEMAQ7BEwEPQQ+BDkEIAAQBDcEOAQ4BCwAIABHBEIEPgQgADIEIAA6BD4EPQQ1BEcEPQQ+BDwEIAA4BEIEPgQzBDUEIAA\\/BEAENQQyBEAEMARCBDgEOwQ+BCAAQAQ1BDMEOAQ+BD0EIAA4BDcEIAA\\/BDAEQQRBBDgEMgQ9BD4EMwQ+BCAAPwQ+BDsEQwRHBDAEQgQ1BDsETwQgADwENQQ2BDQEQwQ9BDAEQAQ+BDQEPQQ+BDkEIAA\\\\/BDAEQQQ1BD0EOARPBCAAEARABDAEOwQwBCAAKAAcBCQEIQQQBCkAIAA4BCAAPwQ1BEAENQRFBD4ENAQgADgENwQgAD8ENQRABDgEPgQ0BDAEIACrADIEPgQ0BD0EPgQzBD4EIAA\\/BEAEPgRCBDgEMgQ+BEEEQgQ+BE8EPQQ4BE8EuwAgADoEIAA\\\\\\\\/BEAEPgQzBEAEMAQ8BDwEIAA\\\\\\/BEAEPgQxBDsENQQ8BCAAPQQwBCAAQQQ+BDMEOwQwBEEEPgQyBDAEPQQ4BDUEIAA6BD4EPQQ6BEAENQRCBD0ESwRFBCAAPwQ7BDAEPQQ+BDIEIAA\\/BD4EIAA\\\\\\/BEAENQQyBEAEMARCBDgEOwQ4BCAAQAQ1BDMEOAQ+BD0EIAAyBCAANwQwBDwENQRCBD0EPgQzBD4EIABDBEcEMARBBEIEPQQ4BDoEMAQgAE0EQgQ+BDkEIAAzBDsEPgQxBDAEOwRMBD0EPgQ5BCAANAQ4BEEEOgRDBEEEQQQ4BDgELAAgADIEOwQ4BE8EPQQ4BDUEIAA6BD4EQgQ+BEAEPgQzBD4EIAA\\\\\\/BEAEOARABD4ENAQ9BEsENQQgAEAENQRBBEMEQARBBEsEIAA4BDsEOAQgAEIEQAQwBD0ENwQ4BEIEPQRLBDkEIAA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\/BDsENQQ9BDgENQQgAEEEQgRABDAEPQQgACYENQQ9BEIEQAQwBDsETAQ9BD4EOQQgABAENwQ4BDgEIAAyBCAAOgQwBEcENQRBBEIEMgQ1BCAAQQQ\\/BDsEPgRHBDUEPQQ9BD4EMwQ+BCAAOgQ7BDgEPAQwBEIEOARHBDUEQQQ6BD4EMwQ+BCAAMQQ7BD4EOgQwBCAAPQQwBCAAMQRDBDQEQwRJBDgERQQgADoEPgQ9BEQENQRABDUEPQRGBDgETwRFBCAAQwBPAFAAIAA\\/BD4ENwQyBD4EOwQ4BEIEIAA\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Markaziy Osiyo bugun...<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">iqlim tahdidlari va yangi siyosiy voqelik sabab bo\'lgan baxtsiz ekologik o\'zgarishlar. Maqolada transchegaraviy muammolarga birgalikda javob izlashda mintaqa davlatlarining konsolidatsiya jarayoni ko\'rib chiqiladi. Atrof-muhit bo\'yicha kun tartibi 2025-2<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">026 ikkinchi darajali bo\'lishni to\'xtatdi va \\\"yashil diplomatiya\\\" ning asosiy vositasiga aylandi. Ekotizimlarni saqlash va barqaror rivojlanish boÔÇİyicha kompleks chora-tadbirlarni amalga oshirishning strategik asosi sifatida mintaqaviy oÔÇİzaro hamkorlik istiqbollari ochib berilgan.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Markaziy Osiyodagi integratsiya dinamikasi mintaqa mamlakatlarida keng koÔÇİlamli ijtimoiy-iqtisodiy tiklanishni boshlab berdi. Milliy iqtisodiyotning jadal o\'sishi, jadal urbanizatsiya va sanoat salohiyatining rivojlanishi mamlakatlarni olib keldi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Viloyatda aholi turmush farovonligi yuksalishi, investitsiyalar hajmining oshishi va savdo-sotiqning mustahkamlanishi kabi inkor etib boÔÇİlmaydigan imtiyozlarga erishildi. Biroq, bu taraqqiyotning salbiy tomoni ham bor - atrof-muhit uchun xarajatlar ortib bormoqda, bu esa aholining hayot sifatiga tobora ko\'proq ta\'sir qilmoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bugungi kunda mintaqa paradoks bilan yuzma-yuz turibdi ÔÇô iqtisodiy yutuqlar ogÔÇİir ekologik voqeliklar bilan cheklana boshladi, chuqur tushunish va adekvat javob berishni talab qiladi. Bu muammo mahalliy epizod emas,<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">lekin kengroq global tendentsiyaning bir qismi. \\\"Global qayta tiklash\\\" doirasida jahon hamjamiyatining ilg\'or mamlakatlari o\'zlarining rivojlanish strategiyalarini qayta ko\'rib chiqmoqdalar va ESG ijtimoiy va ekologik mas\'uliyat va \\\"yashil\\\" protektsionizm standartlariga o\'tmoqdalar.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ushbu o\'zgarishlarning epitsentridagi o\'z mavqeini anglagan holda, uzoq vaqt davomida xalqaro iqlimning chekkasida qolib ketgan Markaziy Osiyo<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Atik munozaralar, bugungi kunda birinchi o\'ringa chiqadi. Ushbu metamorfoz transchegaraviy muammolar - muzliklarning erishidan tortib megapolislarda havoning keskin ifloslanishigacha - chegaralarni hurmat qilmasligi va birlashtirilgan qadamlarni talab qilishini tushunish bilan bog\'liq.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>O\'tgan o\'n yillikning retrospektivi - parchalanishdan muvofiqlashtirishgacha bo\'lgan yo\'l<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">So\'nggi o\'n yil<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bular Markaziy Osiyo mamlakatlarida ekologik muammolarni hal qilish yoÔÇİllarini idrok etishda bosqichma-bosqich paradigma oÔÇİzgarishi davri boÔÇİldi, bu esa pirovardida mintaqani xalqaro yordamning passiv oluvchisidan iqlim muammolarini hal etishning faol tashabbuskoriga aylantirdi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Iqlim bo\'yicha Parij kelishuvining imzolanishi asosiy turtki bo\'ldi, bu inventarizatsiyaga hissa qo\'shdi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">mintaqa mamlakatlarida milliy risklar va qonunchilikni yangilash. Orolni qutqarish xalqaro jamgÔÇİarmasi (IFAS) doirasidagi muloqotning qayta tiklanishi va ÔÇ£suv qarama-qarshiligiÔÇØ davridan ekologik tahdidlarning umumiyligini tan olishga oÔÇİtish asosiy yutuq boÔÇİldi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Markaziy Osiyo davlatlari rahbarlarining maslahat uchrashuvlari atrof-muhitni eng yuqori darajadagi ustuvor mavzu sifatida taqdim etdi va bu haqiqiy diplomatik yutuq boÔÇİldi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Mintaqaviy Ekologik Markaz (CAREC) iqlim oÔÇİzgarishiga moslashish boÔÇİyicha yuzlab pilot loyihalarni amalga oshirish uchun davlat organlari, ilm-fan va fuqarolik jamiyatini birlashtirgan asosiy ekspert platformasiga aylandi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">O╩╗rmonlarni o╩╗stirish bo╩╗yicha keng ko╩╗lamli milliy dasturlarni ishga tushirish.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Yashil<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Makon<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">\\\"Va\\\"<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Jasyl<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">beldeu<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">┬╗ chang bo\'ronlari va tuproq degradatsiyasiga javob bo\'lib, mintaqaviy miqyosga ega bo\'ldi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bu va boshqa chora-tadbirlar e\'tiborni asta-sekin muammolarni oddiy muhokama qilishdan texnologiya, moliya va boshqa resurslarni jalb qilish bo\'yicha aniq rejalar bo\'yicha kelishishga o\'tkazish imkonini berdi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Mintaqadagi davlatlar sinxron tarzda amalga oshira boshladilar<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">megaloyihalar<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">qayta tiklanadigan energiya sohasida<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">energiya ishlab chiqarish<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, ularni ekotizimlar va issiqlik elektr stantsiyalariga yukni kamaytirish usuli sifatida ko\'rib chiqish.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Markaziy Osiyo delegatsiyalarining BMTning iqlim boÔÇİyicha konferensiyalarida (COP) muvofiqlashtirilgan ishtiroki mintaqani ushbu global muhokamaning nufuzli ishtirokchisiga aylantirdi, uning taÔÇÖsiri barqaror oÔÇİsib bormoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ko\'pchilik ichida<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Muhimi, mintaqa resurslar masalasida ishonchsizlik inqiroz davrini yengdi. OÔÇİzaro hamkorlikning oÔÇİziga xos arxitekturasi yaratildi, unda ekologiya beshta davlatni yagona maqsad ÔÇô kelajak avlodlar uchun yashash muhitini saqlab qolish atrofida birlashtiruvchi ÔÇ£yumshoq kuchÔÇØga aylandi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>Global reset va kelajak ufqlari<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bugun Markaziy Osiyo yangi bosqichga kirdi, uni shunday taÔÇÖriflash mumkin<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">mintaqaviy konsolidatsiyadan global muhitga integratsiyaga o\'tish. Atrof-muhit sohasidagi \\\"global qayta o\'rnatish\\\" ham yangi qoidalarni talab qiladi. Iqlimga chidamlilik tabiiy resurslar yoki tranzit salohiyati kabi kuchli boylikka aylanib bormoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Vn<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Mintaqaning ertalab \\\"konfor narxi\\\" bilan bog\'liq yangi tanqidiy nuqtalar paydo bo\'ldi. Portlovchi motorizatsiya, issiqlik elektr stantsiyalarining eng yuqori quvvatda ishlashi va shahar atrofidagi qishloq xo\'jaligi majmualarining rivojlanishi mintaqaning eng yirik shaharlari uchun ijtimoiy xavfga aylangan tutun muammosini yaratdi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bu muammoni hal qilish nafaqat quvurlarga filtrlarni oÔÇİrnatishni, balki kompleks yondashuvni ÔÇô mintaqadagi suv, energetika va oziq-ovqat tarmoqlari oÔÇİrtasida chuqur muvofiqlashtirishni joriy etishni talab qiladi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">davlatlararo<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">darajasi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shu nuqtai nazardan, kelgusi yillar konsolidatsiya uchun hal qiluvchi bo\'ladi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">sub\'ektivlik<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">shu ma\'noda mintaqa.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bu yoÔÇİlda eng muhim bosqich Ostonada boÔÇİlib oÔÇİtgan Mintaqaviy ekologik sammit boÔÇİldi. Ushbu tadbir shunchaki mo\'ljallangan emas<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">qo\'yib yuborish; ishonchni oqlamaslik<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">so\'nggi o\'n yilliklar natijalari,<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">balki texnologik yangilash bo╩╗yicha uzoq muddatli ÔÇ£Yo╩╗l xaritasiÔÇØni shakllantirish. Aynan shu platformada Markaziy Osiyo iqlim jamgÔÇİarmasining ish mexanizmlari birlashtirilib, atrof-muhitga oid tashabbuslarni aniq investitsiya holatlariga aylantiradi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ko\'rinib turibdiki, mintaqaviy kun tartibining kelajagi global o\'zgarishlar ritmida uchta ustuvor yo\'nalish atrofida quriladi:<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Birinchisi, texnologik suverenitet. Mintaqa ekologik yechimlarni import qilishdan ularni mahalliylashtirish, joriy etishga oÔÇİtishga intiladi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">issiqlik elektr stansiyalarida suvdan \\\"aqlli\\\" foydalanish va chiqindilarni raqamli monitoring qilish tizimlari.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ikkinchi -<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ko\'kalamzorlashtirish<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">iqtisodiyot. ESG standartlari milliy kompaniyalar faoliyatiga integratsiya qilinadi, bu esa global bozorlarda uglerodni tartibga solish sharoitida yashil moliyalashtirishga yaxshiroq kirishni ta\'minlaydi va eksport raqobatbardoshligini ta\'minlaydi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">T<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">uchinchidan - pozitsiyalarni mustahkamlash. Markaziy Osiyo davlatlarining bo\'lajak COP konferentsiyalarida yaxlit iqlim bloki sifatida ishtirok etishi ularga moslashish dasturlarini xalqaro qo\'llab-quvvatlash masalalarida o\'z shartlarini ilgari surish imkonini beradi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;border-left:none;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Aytish mumkinki, Markaziy Osiyoda ekologiya nihoyat gumanitar mavzudan aylanib bormoqda<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">strategik<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">. Mintaqa tajribasi ishonchli tarzda isbotlab turibdiki, transgrga javob berish mumkin va zarur<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">raqobat orqali emas, balki sinergiya orqali noyob qiyinchiliklar. Bunday yondashuv Markaziy Osiyo bugungi kunda ÔÇ£iqlim ofat zonasiÔÇØ emas, balki butun Yevroosiyo uchun barqaror rivojlanishning yangi modeli tugÔÇİilayotgan imkoniyatlar maydoni ekanligiga umid beradi.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"ru\":\"<h2 style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ºĞºÁº¢ªéªÇº░º╗ªîº¢º░ªÅ ºÉºÀº©ªÅ ªüºÁº│º¥º┤º¢ªÅ º┐ªÇº¥ªàº¥º┤º©ªé º┐ªâªéªî º│º╗<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ªâº▒º¥º║º¥º╣ ªıº║º