DkEIAAQBDcEOAQ4BCwAIABHBEIEPgQgADIEIAA6BD4EPQQ1BEcEPQQ+BDwEIAA4BEIEPgQzBDUEIAA\\/BEAENQQyBEAEMARCBDgEOwQ+BCAAQAQ1BDMEOAQ+BD0EIAA4BDcEIAA\\/BDAEQQRBBDgEMgQ9BD4EMwQ+BCAAPwQ+BDsEQwRHBDAEQgQ1BDsETwQgADwENQQ2BDQEQwQ9BDAEQAQ+BDQEPQQ+BDkEIAA\\\\/BDAEQQQ1BD0EOARPBCAAEARABDAEOwQwBCAAKAAcBCQEIQQQBCkAIAA4BCAAPwQ1BEAENQRFBD4ENAQgADgENwQgAD8ENQRABDgEPgQ0BDAEIACrADIEPgQ0BD0EPgQzBD4EIAA\\/BEAEPgRCBDgEMgQ+BEEEQgQ+BE8EPQQ4BE8EuwAgADoEIAA\\\\\\\\/BEAEPgQzBEAEMAQ8BDwEIAA\\\\\\/BEAEPgQxBDsENQQ8BCAAPQQwBCAAQQQ+BDMEOwQwBEEEPgQyBDAEPQQ4BDUEIAA6BD4EPQQ6BEAENQRCBD0ESwRFBCAAPwQ7BDAEPQQ+BDIEIAA\\/BD4EIAA\\\\\\/BEAENQQyBEAEMARCBDgEOwQ4BCAAQAQ1BDMEOAQ+BD0EIAAyBCAANwQwBDwENQRCBD0EPgQzBD4EIABDBEcEMARBBEIEPQQ4BDoEMAQgAE0EQgQ+BDkEIAAzBDsEPgQxBDAEOwRMBD0EPgQ5BCAANAQ4BEEEOgRDBEEEQQQ4BDgELAAgADIEOwQ4BE8EPQQ4BDUEIAA6BD4EQgQ+BEAEPgQzBD4EIAA\\\\\\/BEAEOARABD4ENAQ9BEsENQQgAEAENQRBBEMEQARBBEsEIAA4BDsEOAQgAEIEQAQwBD0ENwQ4BEIEPQRLBDkEIAA\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\\/BDsENQQ9BDgENQQgAEEEQgRABDAEPQQgACYENQQ9BEIEQAQwBDsETAQ9BD4EOQQgABAENwQ4BDgEIAAyBCAAOgQwBEcENQRBBEIEMgQ1BCAAQQQ\\/BDsEPgRHBDUEPQQ9BD4EMwQ+BCAAOgQ7BDgEPAQwBEIEOARHBDUEQQQ6BD4EMwQ+BCAAMQQ7BD4EOgQwBCAAPQQwBCAAMQRDBDQEQwRJBDgERQQgADoEPgQ9BEQENQRABDUEPQRGBDgETwRFBCAAQwBPAFAAIAA\\/BD4ENwQyBD4EOwQ4BEIEIAA\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Central Asia today is on the path of...<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">wretched environmental transformation caused by both climate threats and the new political reality. The article examines the process of consolidation of the countries of the region in search of joint responses to cross-border challenges. Environmental Agenda 2025-2<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">026 has ceased to be secondary, turning into the main instrument of ÔÇ£green diplomacyÔÇØ. The prospects for regional interaction are revealed as a strategic basis for the implementation of comprehensive measures for the conservation of ecosystems and sustainable development.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Integration dynamics in Central Asia initiated a large-scale socio-economic renaissance in the countries of the region. The intensive growth of national economies, rapid urbanization and the development of industrial potential have brought countries<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">The region has received undeniable benefits in the form of improved living standards, increased investment and strengthened trade. However, this progress also has a downside - increasing costs for the environment, which are increasingly affecting the quality of life of the population.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Today, the region is faced with a paradox - economic achievements are beginning to be limited by harsh environmental realities, requiring deep understanding and an adequate response. This challenge is by no means a local episode,<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">but part of a broader global trend. As part of the ÔÇ£global reset,ÔÇØ progressive countries of the world community are reviewing their development strategies and moving to ESG standards of social and environmental responsibility and ÔÇ£greenÔÇØ protectionism.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Realizing its position at the epicenter of this transformation, Central Asia, which for a long time remained on the periphery of international climate<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">atic discussions, today comes to the forefront. This metamorphosis is dictated by the understanding that transboundary challenges - from melting glaciers to critical air pollution in megacities - do not respect borders and require consolidated steps.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>Retrospective of the past decade - the path from fragmentation to coordination<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Last ten years<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">These became a period of gradual paradigm shift in the perception of ways to solve environmental problems in the countries of Central Asia, which ultimately turned the region from a passive recipient of international assistance into an active initiator of climate solutions.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">The main impetus was the signing of the Paris Climate Agreement, which contributed to the inventory of<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">national risks and updating legislation in the countries of the region. The key achievement was the resumption of dialogue within the framework of the International Fund for Saving the Aral Sea (IFAS) and the transition from the period of ÔÇ£water confrontationÔÇØ to the recognition of the commonality of environmental threats.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Consultative meetings of the heads of state of Central Asia introduced the environment as a top-level priority topic, which became a real diplomatic breakthrough.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">The Regional Environmental Center (CAREC) has become a key expert platform that brings together government agencies, science and civil society to implement hundreds of pilot projects on adaptation to climate change.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Launch of large-scale national afforestation programs such as ÔÇ£<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Yashil<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Macon<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">\\\" And \\\"<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Zhasyl<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">beldeu<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">┬╗ has acquired a regional dimension, becoming a response to dust storms and soil degradation.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">These and other measures made it possible to gradually shift the focus from simply discussing problems to agreeing on specific plans to attract technology, finance and other resources.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Countries in the region began to synchronously implement<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">megaprojects<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">in the field of renewable<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">energy generation<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, considering them as a way to reduce the load on ecosystems and thermal power plants.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">The coordinated participation of Central Asian delegations in the UN climate conferences (COP) has turned the region into a prominent participant in this global discussion, whose influence is steadily growing.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Most in<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Importantly, the region has overcome the crisis period of mistrust in matters of resources. A unique architecture of interaction was created, where ecology became a ÔÇ£soft powerÔÇØ uniting five states around a common goal - preserving the habitat for future generations.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>Global reset and future horizons<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Today, Central Asia has entered a new stage, which can be described as<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">transition from regional consolidation to integration into the global environment. The ÔÇ£global resetÔÇØ in the environmental sphere also dictates new rules. Climate resilience is becoming an asset as powerful as natural resources or transit potential.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Vn<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">In the morning of the region, new critical points related to the ÔÇ£price of comfortÔÇØ have emerged. Explosive motorization, the operation of thermal power plants at peak capacity and the development of suburban agricultural complexes have created a smog problem that has become a social threat for the largest cities in the region.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Solving this problem requires not just filters on pipes, but the introduction of an integrated approach - deep coordination between the water, energy and food sectors in the region.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">intercountry<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">level.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">In this context, the coming years will be decisive for consolidating<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">subjectivity<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">region in this sense.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">The most important milestone on this path was the Regional Environmental Summit in Astana. This event is not just intended<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">let down<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">results of the past decades,<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">but also to form a long-term ÔÇ£Road MapÔÇØ for technological renewal. It is on this platform that the work mechanisms of the Central Asian Climate Fund will be consolidated, which will turn environmental initiatives into specific investment cases.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">It is obvious that the future of the regional agenda, in the rhythm of global changes, will be built around three priorities:<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">The first is technological sovereignty. The region will strive to move from importing environmental solutions to their localization, implementation<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">systems for ÔÇ£smartÔÇØ water use and digital monitoring of emissions at thermal power plants.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Second -<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">greening<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">economy. ESG standards will be integrated into the activities of national companies, which will provide better access to green finance and maintain export competitiveness in the context of carbon regulation in global markets.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">T<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">third ÔÇô consolidation of positions. The performance of the Central Asian countries as a cohesive climate bloc at future COP conferences will allow them to promote their conditions in matters of international support for adaptation programs.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;border-left:none;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">It can be stated that ecology in Central Asia is finally transforming from a humanitarian topic into<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">strategic<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">. The experience of the region convincingly proves that it is possible and necessary to respond to transgr<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">unique challenges not through competition, but through synergy. This approach gives hope that Central Asia today is no longer a ÔÇ£climate disaster zoneÔÇØ, but a space of opportunity where a new model of sustainable development is being born for the whole of Eurasia.<\\/span><\\/p>\"}',1,'{\"uz\":\"\",\"ru\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"}'),
('mrbxmgphoqd8','{\"uz\":\"SPIEF 2026: OÔÇİzbekiston va Yevroosiyo ulanishining yangi kun tartibi\",\"ru\":\"ºşº£º¡ºñ-2026: º¢º¥º▓º░ªÅ º┐º¥º▓ºÁªüªéº║º░ º┤º╗ªÅ ªüº¥ºÁº┤º©º¢ºÁº¢º©ªÅ ºúºÀº▒ºÁº║º©ªüªéº░º¢º░ º© ºòº▓ªÇº░ºÀº©º©\",\"en\":\"SPIEF 2026: a new agenda for connecting Uzbekistan and Eurasia\"}','Ma\'ruza','Tashqi siyosat','Markaziy Osiyo','ºöº░ªÇªîªÅ ºôº¥ªÇºÁº╗º║º©º¢º░  ','2026','published','uploads/img_20260727_081053_cbc0ee5f.jpg','uploads/doc_20260728_064929_ec58003f.pdf','{\"uz\":\"<h3 style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">O\'tgan&nbsp;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Sankt-Peterburg xalqaro iqtisodiy forumi&nbsp;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">shuni ko\'rsatdi&nbsp;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">klassik tovar operatsiyalari uchun platforma bo\'lishni to\'xtatdi. Bugungi kunda bu erda konturlar shakllanmoqda&nbsp;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">yangi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">geoiqtisodiyot<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">.<\\/span><\\/h3><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bu zamonga berilgan hurmatdir.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Globallashuvning eski modeli o╩╗rnini mintaqaviy iqtisodiy bloklar, texnologik suverenitet uchun kurash va<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">yangilarini shakllantirish<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">logistik jihatdan<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">X<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">marshrut<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ov<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ushbu o\'zgarishlarning markazida<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">-<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Markaziy Osiyo. OÔÇİzbekiston Prezidentining nutqi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shavkata<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Mirziyoyeva<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">SPIEF 2026 da paradigma o\'zgarishini aniq ko\'rsatdi: mintaqa endi passiv ta\'sir ob\'ekti emas.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">tashqi kuchlar<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Markaziy Osiyo o\'zini mustaqil davlat deb ta\'kidlamoqda<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">iqtisodiy<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Yevroosiyo integratsiyasining markazi va asosiy tugunidir.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i><b>Tranzitdan<\\/b><\\/i><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i><b>iqtisodiy<\\/b><\\/i><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i><b> <\\/b><\\/i><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i><b>sub\'ektivlik<\\/b><\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Uzoq vaqt davomida mintaqaning imkoniyatlari ko\'rib chiqildi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Xia<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">faqat geografiya prizmasi orqali<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">-<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Sharq va GÔÇİarb oÔÇİrtasida qulay tranzit yoÔÇİlagi sifatida. Toshkent tubdan boshqacha yondashuvni taklif etadi: passiv vositachilikdan oÔÇİzining sanoat bazasini yaratishga oÔÇİtish.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Zamonaviy haqiqatda yo\'llarning uzunligi va elektr uzatish liniyalarining kuchi endi etakchilikni kafolatlamaydi. Nomoddiy omillar birinchi o\'ringa chiqadi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">:<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">O<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Umumiy raqamli platformalar va mustaqil to\'lov tizimlari<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">;<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">G<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">mintaqada chuqur ishlab chiqarish kooperatsiyasi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">;<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">da<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ta\'minot zanjirlarining tashqi zarbalarga chidamliligi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Markaziy Osiyo uchun noyob tarixiy oyna ochildi. Transport, IT yechimlari va sanoatning sinxron rivojlanishi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">-<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">bu makroregionning omon qolishi va rivojlanishining asosiy strategiyasidir.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i><b>\\\"Evroosiyo texnologik sanoatlashtirish kamari\\\"<\\/b><\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Forumda Toshkentning asosiy tashabbusi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">-<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Yevroosiyo texnologik sanoatlashtirish kamarini yaratish. Bu global javobdir<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Voy-buy<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">tashkilotni qayta qurish<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ishlab chiqarish<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">X<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ulanish<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">unga<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bu oddiy tovarlar almashinuvi haqida emas, balki oxir-oqibat sanoat va texnologik klasterlarni yaratish haqida. Amaliy vosita<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">buning uchun yagona raqamli platforma bo\'ladi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">sanoat kooperatsiyasi formati<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">. U bo\'g\'indan barcha bosqichlarni bog\'laydi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ishlanmalar<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ishlab chiqarishni mahalliylashtirish va uchinchi davlatlarga birgalikda eksport qilishdan oldin muhandislarni tayyorlash.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Buning uchun doimiy markazlashtirilgan nuqta<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">th tizimlari<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ko\'rgazma namoyishga tayyor\\\"<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Innoprom<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">. Markaziy OsiyoÔÇØ har yili Toshkentda bo╩╗lib o╩╗tadi va o╩╗z samarasini allaqachon isbotlagan.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i><b>Yagona raqamli muhit va transchegaraviy mehnat bozori<\\/b><\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Postindustrial davrda raqamli platformalar jismoniy infratuzilmani almashtirmoqda. Toshkent hamkorlarni rad etishga taklif qiladi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">tarqoq<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">IT yagona raqamli ekotizim foydasiga loyihalar.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Dastlabki bosqichda taxminan<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">o\'z ichiga oladi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">G<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Eng yirik brendlarni targ\'ib qilish uchun elektron tijorat qoidalarini uyg\'unlashtirish<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">bozorlar<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, Bilan<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">sun\'iy intellekt sohasidagi qo\'shma ishlanmalar<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">va e<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">yagona raqamli bandlik profili.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bu kalit<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">birinchi qadamlar<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, qaysi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">e<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">bajarildi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">yu<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">t transchegaraviy mehnat bozori qonuniy, shaffof va himoyalangan<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">jarayonning barcha ishtirokchilari<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i><b>Inson kapitali geoiqtisodiy kozoz sifatida<\\/b><\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Markaziy Osiyo XXI asrning asosiy resursiga ega<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">-<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">yosh va dinamik aholi. Bu demografiyani aylantirish uchun<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">dividend<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">real iqtisodiy ustunlikka erishish, O\'zbekiston yaratish tashabbusi bilan chiqdi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">qo\'shma<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt