-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">This is a tribute to the times.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">The old model of globalization is being replaced by regional economic blocs, the struggle for technological sovereignty and<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">formation of new<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">logistically<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">X<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">route<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ov<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">At the center of these changes<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ÔÇô<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Central Asia. Speech by the President of Uzbekistan<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-