n the largest<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">marketplaces<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, With<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">joint developments in the field of artificial intelligence<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">and e<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">single digital employment profile.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">This is the key<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">first steps<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, which<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">e<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">done<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">yu<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">t cross-border labor market legal, transparent and protected for<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">all participants in the process<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i><b>Human capital as a geo-economic trump card<\\/b><\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Central Asia has the main resource of the 21st century<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ÔÇô<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">young and dynamic population. To turn this demographic<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">dividend<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">into a real economic advantage, Uzbekistan initiated the creation<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">joint<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">online platforms for human capital development.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">The project will directly connect<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">educational<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">environment, high-tech production and a changing labor market.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Investments in people\'s competencies will determine what place the macroregion will take in the new global economy.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i><b>Pragmatism strategy<\\/b><\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">UzbekistanÔÇÖs initiatives at SPIEF 2026 are based on<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">durable<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">internal<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">yuyu<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">bases<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">at<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">. Over the past decade, the country has carried out large-scale modernization: diversifying its industry, attracting billions of dollars in investment and digitizing<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">public administration<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Thus<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">,<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Tashkent brought to St. Petersburg not just a list of investment projects, but a ready-made long-term doctrine<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">joint<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">development. It is based on the synergy of logistics, industry,<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">IT<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">and people<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">sheep capital.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:110%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;border-left:none;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">In an era of global instability, this is a viable growth model based on pragmatism, mutual trust and shared technological security.<\\/span><\\/p>\"}',3,'{\"uz\":\"\",\"ru\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"}'),
('mrbxmgphs2lv','{\"uz\":\"OTS: Turkiy xalqlarning taraqqiyot va farovonlik yo╩╗lidagi sa╩╝y-harakatlarini birlashtirish markazi\",\"ru\":\"ºŞºóºí: ºĞºÁº¢ªéªÇ º║º¥º¢ªüº¥º╗º©º┤º░ªåº©º© ªâªüº©º╗º©º╣ ªéªÄªÇº║ªüº║º©ªà º¢º░ªÇº¥º┤º¥º▓ º¢º░ º┐ªâªéº© º║ º┐ªÇº¥º│ªÇºÁªüªüªâ º© º┐ªÇº¥ªåº▓ºÁªéº░º¢º©ªÄ\",\"en\":\"OTS: A Center for Consolidating the Efforts of the Turkic Nations Towards Progress and Prosperity\"}','Tahliliy sharh','Iqtisodiyot','Markaziy Osiyo','Shukhrat Irgashev','2026','published','uploads/img_20260727_083248_04e9276a.jpg','uploads/doc_20260728_064900_21ee2f63.docx','{\"uz\":\"<p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\" class=\\\"docData;DOCY;v5;33221;\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">2026-yil 15-may kuni Turkiston shahrida Turkiy davlatlar tashkilotining (OTT) norasmiy sammiti ÔÇ£SunÔÇÖiylikÔÇØ mavzusida boÔÇİlib oÔÇİtdi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">l Intellekt va raqamli rivojlanish.ÔÇØ Rahbarlar savdo, sarmoya, transport va kommunikatsiyalar, atrof-muhitni muhofaza qilish, raqamli infratuzilmani rivojlantirish, innovatsion texnologiyalarni joriy etish boÔÇİyicha hamkorlikni yanada mustahkamlashga eÔÇÖtibor qaratdilar.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Turkiston sammiti nafaqat turkiy davlatlar, balki kengroq Markaziy Osiyo mintaqasi uchun ham alohida ahamiyatga ega. Zamonaviy xalqaro o\'zgarishlar demonstr<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Barqaror milliy rivojlanish tobora ko\'proq iqtisodiy raqamlashtirish darajasiga, texnologik suverenitetga, sun\'iy intellektning (AI) rivojlanishiga va global logistika va axborot tarmoqlariga integratsiyalashuv qobiliyatiga bog\'liqligini ta\'kidladi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shu nuqtai nazardan, OTS asosan madaniy-gumanitar tashkilotdan iqtisodiy va texnologik hamkorlik uchun keng qamrovli platformaga aylanib bormoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Sammitda sun╩╝iy intellektni amaliy qo╩╗llash masalalariga alohida e╩╝tibor qaratildi. Bugungi kunda AI texnologiyalari global raqobatbardoshlikning asosiy omillaridan biriga aylandi. Ular tobora integratsiyalashgan<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">davlat boshqaruvi, transport, sanoat, sog\'liqni saqlash, ta\'lim va xavfsizlik. Binobarin, sun\'iy intellektning rivojlanishi bugungi kunda ko\'plab mamlakatlar tomonidan milliy suverenitet va iqtisodiy barqarorlikning muhim tarkibiy qismi sifatida qaralmoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shu nuqtai nazardan, OÔÇİzbekiston Respublikasi Prezidentining ishtiroki,<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shavkat<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Mirziyoyev<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, alohida ahamiyat kasb etdi. SoÔÇİnggi yillarda OÔÇİzbekiston OTS doirasidagi ishtirokini izchil kengaytirib bordi va tashkilotning turkiy integratsiyani chuqurlashtirishning eng faol tarafdorlaridan biri sifatida namoyon boÔÇİldi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>Sun\'iy intellekt turkiy hamkorlikning yangi o\'lchovi sifatida<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Birinchi marta sun\'iy intellekt tashkilotning strategik texnologik rivojlanish masalalarini hal qilishga o\'tishini aks ettiruvchi OTS sammitining markaziy mavzusiga aylandi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bugungi kunda turkiy davlatlar umumiy muammolarga duch kelmoqda, jumladan:<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">o\'z iqtisodiyotlarining raqamli transformatsiyasini tezlashtirish;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">milliy IT tarmoqlarini rivojlantirish;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ta\'minlash<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">kiberxavfsizlik<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">yuqori malakali mutaxassislarni tayyorlash; va<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">tashqi ta\'sir markazlariga texnologik qaramlikni kamaytirish.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shu fonda OÔÇİzbekiston Prezidenti tomonidan bir qancha tashabbuslar ilgari surildi. Xususan, u hududiy ma╩╝lumotlar markazlarini yuqori tezlikdagi aloqa tarmoqlari orqali ulashga mo╩╗ljallangan ÔÇ£Raqamli turkiy yo╩╗lakÔÇØ konsepsiyasini ishlab chiqishni taklif qildi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Amaliy hamkorlikni yanada mustahkamlash uchun O╩╗zbekiston Toshkent shahrida OTSga a╩╝zo barcha davlatlar ishtirokida Texnologiyalar forumini o╩╗tkazishni taklif qildi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">O╩╗zaro hamkorlikni kengaytirishga ham alohida e╩╝tibor qaratildi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">fan, taÔÇÖlim va yoshlar siyosati. Viloyatning umumiy tarixiy-maÔÇÖnaviy merosini oÔÇİrganish va targÔÇİib qilish maqsadida tashkil etilgan Toshkent shahridagi Islom sivilizatsiyasi markazi yirik mintaqaviy ilmiy-taÔÇÖlim markaziga aylanib borayotgani taÔÇÖkidlandi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shu munosabat bilan OÔÇİzbekiston Islom sivilizatsiyasi markazi, T├£RKSOY va Turkiy akademiyaning barcha turkiy xalqlar manfaati uchun tarixiy va madaniy manbalarni yagona katta maÔÇÖlumotlar platformasida birlashtirish boÔÇİyicha saÔÇÖy-harakatlarini birlashtirishni taklif qildi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bundan tashqari, OÔÇİzbekiston keng qamrovli tadqiqot tashabbusini koÔÇİtarishni va oÔÇİz ifodasini topgan bagÔÇİrikenglik va maÔÇÖrifat gÔÇİoyalarini xalqaro miqyosda keng targÔÇİib qilishni taklif qildi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Yasaviy<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Buyurtma.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ning shahri ekanligi ham diqqatga sazovordir<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Xiva<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">2026-yil uchun ÔÇ£Turk dunyosi yoshlar poytaxtiÔÇØ deb eÔÇÖlon qilindi. Ushbu tashabbus doirasida OÔÇİzbekiston Yosh liderlar forumi va Xalqaro yoshlar festivalini oÔÇİtkazishga tayyorligini bildirdi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Istiqbolli yoshlar startaplarini, innovatsion loyihalarni va sun╩╝iy intellektga asoslangan yechimlarni qo╩╗llab-quvvatlash maqsadida O╩╗zbekiston OTSga a╩╝zo barcha davlatlarni Qozog╩╗iston bilan hamkorlikda tashkil etilayotgan qo╩╗shma korxona kapitali fondiga qo╩╗shilishga taklif qildi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>Transport aloqasini mustahkamlash<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Transport va logistika koridorlarini rivojlantirish OTS doirasidagi asosiy ustuvor yoÔÇİnalishlardan biri boÔÇİlib qolmoqda. O\'zbekistonning strategik geografik<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">joylashuvi uni Sharq va G╩╗arb, shuningdek, Markaziy va Janubiy Osiyo o╩╗rtasidagi muhim ko╩╗prikga aylantiradi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shu munosabat bilan mintaqaviy transport aloqalarini kengaytirish uchun raqamli logistika platformalarini yaratish va integratsiyalash muhimligi taÔÇÖkidlandi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Global logistikada davom etayotgan o\'zgarishlar fonida alohida ahamiyatga ega<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">e O\'rta yo\'lak sifatida ham tanilgan Transkaspiy xalqaro transport yo\'nalishini rivojlantirish bilan bog\'liq. OÔÇİzbekiston uchun mazkur yoÔÇİlak tashqi savdoni diversifikatsiya qilish va mintaqaning tranzit salohiyatini mustahkamlash uchun qoÔÇİshimcha imkoniyatlar yaratadi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">OÔÇİzbekiston ÔÇ£OÔÇİrta koridorÔÇØning strategik ahamiyatini eÔÇÖtirof etgan holda, uni hozirda qurilayotgan Xitoy ÔÇô QirgÔÇİiziston ÔÇô OÔÇİzbekiston temir yoÔÇİli bilan bogÔÇİlashga alohida eÔÇÖtibor qaratmoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shunga koÔÇİra, soddalashtirilgan bojxona yoÔÇİlagi toÔÇİgÔÇİrisidagi imzolangan bitimning amalda bajarilishini taÔÇÖminlash zarurligi taÔÇÖkidlandi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">chegaradan oÔÇİtish joylarida bojxona rasmiylashtiruvi va tranzit tartib-qoidalari maÔÇÖlumotlar almashinuvini toÔÇİliq raqamlashtirish. Bu logistika zanjiri bo\'ylab ma\'lumotlarni uchdan oxirigacha uzatish, real vaqt rejimida yuklarni kuzatish va transport jarayonlarini muvofiqlashtirilgan boshqarish imkonini beradi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>Ekologik hamkorlik va iqlim xavfsizligi<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Atrof-muhit muammolari tobora kuchayib bormoqda<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">OTSga a\'zo davlatlar uchun muhim ustuvorlik. Turk dunyosi mamlakatlari iqlim oÔÇİzgarishi, suv tanqisligi, choÔÇİllanish, atrof-muhitning ifloslanishi, tabiiy ofatlarning tez-tez koÔÇİpayishi natijasida jiddiy ekologik muammolarga duch kelmoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bu muammolar, ayniqsa, iqlim oÔÇİzgarishi oziq-ovqat xavfsizligi, qishloq xoÔÇİjaligi va barqaror ijtimoiy-iqtisodiy rivojlanishga bevosita taÔÇÖsir koÔÇİrsatadigan Markaziy Osiyoda keskin.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bu masalalarni yanada samarali hal etish uchun OÔÇİzbekiston Prezidenti sunÔÇÖiy yoÔÇİldosh maÔÇÖlumotlari asosida Iqlim xavfi monitoringi OTS tizimini yaratishni taklif qildi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bunday tizim qurgÔÇİoqchilikni erta aniqlash, yerlarning degradatsiyasi va muzliklarning chekinishini doimiy monitoring qilish, shuningdek, sunÔÇÖiy intellekt texnologiyalarini boshqarishda qoÔÇİllash imkonini berishi taÔÇÖkidlandi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">transchegaraviy<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">suv resurslari.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">OÔÇİzbekiston ham atrof-muhitni muhofaza qilishning ahamiyati ortib borayotganini hisobga olib, Turkiy davlatlar tashkiloti doirasida 2027 yilni ÔÇ£Atrof-muhitni muhofaza qilish yiliÔÇØ deb eÔÇÖlon qilishni taklif qildi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>Xavfsizlik va kiber hamkorlik<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Hamkorlikning yana bir muhim yoÔÇİnalishi terrorizm, ekstremizm va buzgÔÇİunchi mafkuralarga qarshi kurashishda huquq-tartibot idoralari oÔÇİrtasidagi hamkorlikni mustahkamlashga qaratilgan.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Sammitda hamkorlikni kengaytirish muhimligi taÔÇÖkidlandi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">kiberxavfsizlik<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, zamonaviy mutaxassislarni tayyorlash, operativ axborot almashinuvini kuchaytirish, yuzaga kelayotgan tahdidlarni aniqlash va oldini olish uchun turkiy dunyo boÔÇİylab xavfsizlik va oÔÇİzaro ishonchning yagona makonini yaratish.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shu munosabat bilan OÔÇİzbekiston umumiy mexanizm ÔÇö Turkiy ittifoq tuzishni taklif qildi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Kiberxavfsizlik<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">va raqamli infratuzilmani himoya qilish.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>Xulosa<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Umuman olganda, Turkistonda bo╩╗lib o╩╗tgan norasmiy sammit Turkiy davlatlar tashkilotining yangi bosqichga qadam qo╩╗yayotganini ko╩╗rsatdi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">institutsional rivojlanish yoshi. Ilgari uning kun tartibi birinchi navbatda madaniy-gumanitar hamkorlikka qaratilgan boÔÇİlsa, endi u tobora koÔÇİproq texnologiya, iqtisodiy rivojlanish, transport aloqasi, sarmoya va raqamli transformatsiyaga qaratilgan.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">F<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">yoki O\'zbekiston sammitda ishtirok etish strategik ahamiyatga ega. Mamlakat ham mintaqaviy integratsiyaning yetakchi omillaridan biri sifatidagi mavqeini mustahkamlashga, ham turkiy dunyoning kelajak taraqqiyotiga oid oÔÇİz qarashlarini ilgari surishga intiladi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;border-left:none;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shunday qilib, Turkiston sammiti diplomatik yig\'ilishdan ko\'ra ko\'proq narsani ifodalaydi. Bu yangi modelni shakllantirishda muhim bosqichdir<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">texnologiya, innovatsiyalar va umumiy rivojlanishga asoslangan mintaqaviy hamkorlik. Bu OÔÇİzbekiston uchun xalqaro obroÔÇİsini mustahkamlash, iqtisodiyotini modernizatsiya qilish, turkiy dunyo davlatlari bilan hamkorlikni kengaytirish uchun qoÔÇİshimcha imkoniyatlar yaratadi.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"ru\":\"<p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-bord