ºÀº©ªåº©º© º▓ º║º░ªçºÁªüªéº▓ºÁ º¥º┤º¢º¥º│º¥ º©ºÀ º▓ºÁº┤ªâªëº©ªà º┤º▓º©º│º░ªéºÁº╗ºÁº╣ ªÇºÁº│º©º¥º¢º░º╗ªîº¢º¥º╣ º©º¢ªéºÁº│ªÇº░ªåº©º©, ªéº░º║ º© º┐ªÇº¥º┤º▓º©º│º░ªéªî ªüº¥º▒ªüªéº▓ºÁº¢º¢º¥ºÁ º▓º©º┤ºÁº¢º©ºÁ º▒ªâº┤ªâªëºÁº│º¥ ªÇº░ºÀº▓º©ªéº©ªÅ ªéªÄªÇº║ªüº║º¥º│º¥ º╝º©ªÇº░.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;border-left:none;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ºóº░º║º©º╝ º¥º▒ªÇº░ºÀº¥º╝, ºóªâªÇº║ºÁªüªéº░º¢ªüº║º©º╣ ªüº░º╝º╝º©ªé º┐ªÇºÁº┤ªüªéº░º▓º╗ªÅºÁªé ªüº¥º▒º¥º╣ º│º¥ªÇº░ºÀº┤º¥ º▒º¥º╗ªîªêºÁ, ªçºÁº╝ º┐ªÇº¥ªüªéº¥ º┤º©º┐º╗º¥º╝º░ªéº©ªçºÁªüº║ªâªÄ º▓ªüªéªÇºÁªçªâ. º¡ªéº¥ ºÀº¢º░º╝ºÁº¢ªâºÁªé ªüº¥º▒º¥º╣ º▓º░ºÂº¢ªâªÄ º▓ºÁªàªâ º▓ ªäº¥ªÇº╝º©ªÇº¥º▓º░º¢º©º© º¢º¥º▓º¥º╣ º╝º¥º┤ºÁº╗º©<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ªÇºÁº│º©º¥º¢º░º╗ªîº¢º¥ºÁ ªüº¥ªéªÇªâº┤º¢º©ªçºÁªüªéº▓º¥, º¥ªüº¢º¥º▓º░º¢º¢º¥ºÁ º¢º░ ªéºÁªàº¢º¥º╗º¥º│º©ªÅªà, º©º¢º¢º¥º▓º░ªåº©ªÅªà º© ªüº¥º▓º╝ºÁªüªéº¢º¥º╝ ªÇº░ºÀº▓º©ªéº©º©. ºöº╗ªÅ ºúºÀº▒ºÁº║º©ªüªéº░º¢º░ ªıªéº¥ ªüº¥ºÀº┤º░ºÁªé º┤º¥º┐º¥º╗º¢º©ªéºÁº╗ªîº¢ªïºÁ º▓º¥ºÀº╝º¥ºÂº¢º¥ªüªéº© º┤º╗ªÅ ªâº║ªÇºÁº┐º╗ºÁº¢º©ªÅ ªüº▓º¥ºÁº│º¥ º╝ºÁºÂº┤ªâº¢º░ªÇº¥º┤º¢º¥º│º¥ º┐º¥º╗º¥ºÂºÁº¢º©ªÅ, º╝º¥º┤ºÁªÇº¢º©ºÀº░ªåº©º© ªıº║º¥º¢º¥º╝º©º║º©, ªÇº░ªüªêº©ªÇºÁº¢º©ªÅ ªüº¥ªéªÇªâº┤º¢º©ªçºÁªüªéº▓º░ ªü º│º¥ªüªâº┤º░ªÇªüªéº▓º░º╝º© ªéªÄªÇº║ªüº║º¥º│º¥ º╝º©ªÇº░.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"en\":\"<p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\" class=\\\"docData;DOCY;v5;33221;\\\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">On 15 May 2026, the informal summit of the Organization of Turkic States (OTS) was held in the city of Turkistan under the theme \\\"Artificia<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">l Intelligence and Digital Development.\\\" The leaders focused on further strengthening cooperation in trade, investment, transport and communications, environmental protection, digital infrastructure development, and the adoption of innovative technologies.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">The Turkistan Summit is of particular significance not only for the Turkic states but also for the broader Central Asian region. Contemporary international developments demonstr<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ate that sustainable national development increasingly depends on the level of economic digitalization, technological sovereignty, the advancement of artificial intelligence (AI), and the ability to integrate into global logistics and information networks.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Against this backdrop, the OTS is gradually evolving from a predominantly cultural and humanitarian organization into a comprehensive platform for economic and technological cooperation.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Particular attention at the summit was devoted to the practical application of artificial intelligence. Today, AI technologies have become one of the key drivers of global competitiveness. They are increasingly integrated <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">into public administration, transportation, industry, healthcare, education, and security. Consequently, the development of artificial intelligence is now regarded by many countries as an essential component of national sovereignty and economic resilience.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">In this context, the participation of the President of the Republic of Uzbekistan, <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shavkat<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Mirziyoyev<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, carried particular importance. In recent years, Uzbekistan has consistently expanded its engagement within the OTS and has emerged as one of the organization\'s most active advocates of deeper Turkic integration.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>Artificial Intelligence as a New Dimension of Turkic Cooperation<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">For the first time, artificial intelligence became the central theme of an OTS summit, reflecting the organization\'s transition toward addressing issues of strategic technological development.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Today, the Turkic states face a common set of challenges, including:<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">accelerating the digital transformation of their economies;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">developing national IT sectors;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ensuring <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">cybersecurity<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">training highly qualified specialists; and<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">reducing technological dependence on external centers of influence.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Against this backdrop, the President of Uzbekistan put forward several initiatives. In particular, he proposed the development of the \\\"Digital Turkic Corridor\\\" concept, designed to connect regional data centers through high-speed communication networks.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">To further strengthen practical cooperation, Uzbekistan proposed holding a Technology Forum in Tashkent with the participation of all OTS member states.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Special emphasis was also placed on enhancing cooperation in<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> science, education, and youth policy. It was noted that the Center of Islamic Civilization in Tashkent, established to study and promote the shared historical and spiritual heritage of the region, is becoming a major regional research and educational hub.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">In this regard, Uzbekistan proposed combining the efforts of the Center of Islamic Civilization, T├£RKSOY, and the Turkic Academy to consolidate historical and cultural sources on a unified big data platform for the benefit of all Turkic peoples.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Furthermore, Uzbekistan proposed launching a comprehensive research initiative and broad international promotion of the ideas of tolerance and enlightenment embodied in the <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Yasawi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> Order.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">It is also noteworthy that the city of <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Khiva<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> has been designated the \\\"Youth Capital of the Turkic World\\\" for 2026. As part of this initiative, Uzbekistan expressed its readiness to host a Young Leaders Forum and an International Youth Festival.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">To support promising youth startups, innovative projects, and AI-based solutions, Uzbekistan invited all OTS member states to join a joint venture capital fund being established in partnership with Kazakhstan.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>Strengthening Transport Connectivity<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">The development of transport and logistics corridors remains one of the key priorities within the OTS framework. Uzbekistan\'s strategic geographical <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">location makes it an important bridge between East and West, as well as between Central and South Asia.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">In this regard, the importance of establishing and integrating digital logistics platforms to enhance regional transport connectivity was emphasized.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Amid ongoing changes in global logistics, particular significanc<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">e is attached to the development of the Trans-Caspian International Transport Route, also known as the Middle Corridor. For Uzbekistan, this corridor creates additional opportunities to diversify foreign trade and strengthen the region\'s transit potential.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Recognizing the strategic importance of the Middle Corridor, Uzbekistan places particular emphasis on linking it with the ChinaÔÇôKyrgyzstanÔÇôUzbekistan railway, which is currently under construction.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Accordingly, the need was highlighted to ensure the practical implementation of the signed Agreement on the Simplified Customs Corridor, aimed at facilitating <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">customs clearance and transit procedures at border crossings while fully digitalizing data exchange. This would enable end-to-end data transmission throughout the logistics chain, real-time cargo tracking, and coordinated management of transport processes.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>Environmental Cooperation and Climate Security<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Environmental issues are becoming an increasingly <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">important priority for OTS member states. The countries of the Turkic world are facing serious environmental challenges resulting from climate change, water scarcity, desertification, environmental pollution, and the growing frequency of natural disasters.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">These challenges are particularly acute in Central Asia, where climate change directly affects food security, agriculture, and sustainable socio-economic development.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">To address these issues more effectively, the President of Uzbekistan proposed establishing an OTS Climate Risk Monitoring System based on satellite data.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">It was emphasized that such a system would enable early drought detection, continuous monitoring of land degradation and glacier retreat, as well as the application of artificial intelligence technologies in the management of <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">transboundary<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> water resources.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Given the growing importance of environmental protection, Uzbekistan also proposed declaring 2027 the Year of Environmental Protection within the Organization of Turkic States.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>Security and Cyber Cooperation<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Another important area of cooperation concerns strengthening collaboration among law enforcement agencies in combating terrorism, extremism, and destructive ideologies.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">The summit highlighted the importance of expanding cooperation in <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">cybersecurity<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, training modern specialists, enhancing operational information exchange, and creating a unified space of security and mutual trust across the Turkic world to identify and prevent emerging threats.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">In this regard, Uzbekistan proposed establishing a common mechanismÔÇöthe Turkic Alliance for <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Cybersecurity<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> and Digital Infrastructure Protection.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>Conclusion<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Overall, the informal summit in Turkistan demonstrated that the Organization of Turkic States is entering a new st<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">age of institutional development. Whereas its agenda previously focused primarily on cultural and humanitarian cooperation, it is now increasingly centered on technology, economic development, transport connectivity, investment, and digital transformation.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">F<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">or Uzbekistan, participation in the summit carries strategic significance. The country seeks both to strengthen its position as one of the leading drivers of regional integration and to promote its own vision for the future development of the Turkic world.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;border-left:none;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Thus, the Turkistan Summit represents far more than a diplomatic gathering. It marks an important milestone in shaping a new model of <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">regional cooperation based on technology, innovation, and shared development. For Uzbekistan, this creates additional opportunities to strengthen its international standing, modernize its economy, and expand cooperation with the states of the Turkic world.<\\/span><\\/p>\"}',2,'{\"uz\":\"\",\"ru\":\"\",\"en\":\"\"}'),
('ms2uz0hvujn0','{\"uz\":\"Global tiklanish davridagi Markaziy Osiyoning ekologik kun tartibi\",\"ru\":\"º¡º║º¥º╗º¥º│º©ªçºÁªüº║º░ªÅ º┐º¥º▓ºÁªüªéº║º░ ºĞºÁº¢ªéªÇº░º╗ªîº¢º¥º╣ ºÉºÀº©º© º▓ ªıº┐º¥ªàªâ º│º╗º¥º▒º░º╗ªîº¢º¥º╣ º┐ºÁªÇºÁºÀº░º│ªÇªâºÀº║º©\",\"en\":\"Central AsiaÔÇÖs Environmental Agenda in the Era of the Global Reset\"}','Hisobot','Tashqi siyosat','Yevropa','Daria Gorelkina','2026','published','uploads/img_20260727_083958_1d903869.jpg','uploads/doc_20260728_064900_21ee2f63.docx','{\"uz\":\"<p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\" class=\\\"docData;DOCY;v5;29809;\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Markaziy Osiyo iqlim bilan bog\'liq tahdidlar va yangi siyosiy voqelik ta\'sirida chuqur ekologik o\'zgarishlarni boshdan kechirmoqda. Ushbu maqola jamoaviy javob izlashda mintaqaning kuchayib borayotgan konsolidatsiyasini ko\'rib chiqadi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">transchegaraviy<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ekologik muammolar. 2025ÔÇô2026 yillardagi atrof-muhitni muhofaza qilish kun tartibi a chegarasidan tashqariga chiqdi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ikkilamchi siyosat masalasi yashil diplomatiyaning markaziy vositasiga aylanishi. Shuningdek, u ekotizimlarni saqlash va barqaror rivojlanishga qaratilgan kompleks chora-tadbirlarni amalga oshirishning strategik asosi sifatida mintaqaviy hamkorlik istiqbollarini oÔÇİrganadi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Markaziy Osiyo boÔÇİylab rivojlanayotgan integratsiya dinamikasi butun mintaqada keng ijtimoiy-iqtisodiy uygÔÇİonish jarayoniga turtki berdi. Tez iqtisodiy o\'sish, tezlashtirilgan urbanizatsiya va kengayish i<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Sanoat salohiyati inkor etib bo\'lmaydigan foyda keltirdi, jumladan, yuqori turmush darajasi, investitsiyalarning ko\'payishi va kuchli savdo. Shu bilan birga, bu taraqqiyot hayot sifatiga tobora kuchayib borayotgan ekologik xarajatlarni keltirib chiqardi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bugungi kunda viloyat f<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">paradoks: uning iqtisodiy yutuqlari atrof-muhit bosimi ortib borayotgani tufayli cheklanib qolmoqda, bu ham strategik mulohazani, ham samarali siyosat choralarini talab qiladi. Bu muammo faqat Markaziy Osiyoga xos emas; balki u birodarning bir qismini tashkil qiladi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ader global tendentsiya. Davom etayotgan global qayta tiklashning bir qismi sifatida dunyo bo\'ylab mamlakatlar o\'zlarining rivojlanish strategiyalarini qayta ko\'rib chiqmoqdalar, ESG (Atrof-muhit, ijtimoiy va boshqaruv) tamoyillarini qabul qilmoqdalar va paydo bo\'layotgan yashil protektsionizm manzarasiga moslashmoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ushbu o\'zgarishlarning markazida turgan o\'z mavqeini tan olgan holda, uzoq vaqtdan beri xalqaro iqlim muhokamalari chegarasida joylashgan Markaziy Osiyo barqaror ravishda birinchi o\'ringa ko\'tarilmoqda. Bu o\'zgarish o\'sib borayotgan tushunchani aks ettiradi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">transchegaraviy<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Muzliklarning chekinishidan tortib shahar havosining jiddiy ifloslanishigacha bo\'lgan muammolar milliy chegaralardan oshib ketadi va muvofiqlashtirilgan mintaqaviy harakatlarni talab qiladi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>Orqaga nazar: parchalanishdan mintaqaviy muvofiqlashtirishgacha<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">O\'tgan o\'n yillikda bosqichma-bosqichlik kuzatildi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">lekin Markaziy Osiyo mamlakatlari ekologik muammolarga qanday yondashayotganida tub o\'zgarishlar. Mintaqa asosan xalqaro ekologik yordam oluvchi davlatdan iqlim bo\'yicha global yechimlarning tobora faol ishtirokchisiga aylandi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ushbu o\'zgarishlarning asosiy katalizatori mintaqa mamlakatlarini milliy iqlim xavflari va rejimini baholashga undagan Parij kelishuvining qabul qilinishi bo\'ldi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">atrof-muhitni muhofaza qilish to\'g\'risidagi qonun hujjatlarini ishlab chiqish. Orolni qutqarish xalqaro jamgÔÇİarmasi (IFAS) doirasida ÔÇ£suv bahslariÔÇØ davridan umumiy ekologik muammolarni eÔÇÖtirof etish sari oÔÇİtishni koÔÇİrsatadigan muloqotning jonlanishi ham xuddi shunday ahamiyat kasb etdi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Markaziy Osiyo davlatlari rahbarlarining maslahat uchrashuvlari ekologik muammolarni eng yuqori siyosiy darajaga koÔÇİtarib, mintaqaviy hamkorlik uchun haqiqiy diplomatik yutuqni koÔÇİrsatdi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Mintaqaviy muhit<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Markaziy Osiyo uchun markaziy markaz (CAREC) iqlimga moslashish va barqaror resurslarni boshqarishga qaratilgan yuzlab pilot loyihalarni amalga oshirish uchun hukumatlar, ilmiy doiralar va fuqarolik jamiyatini birlashtirgan mintaqaning yetakchi ekspert platformasi sifatida paydo bo\'ldi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">kabi keng ko\'lamli o\'rmonlarni o\'stirish bo\'yicha milliy tashabbuslar<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Yashil<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Makon<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">O\'zbekistonda va<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Jasyl<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Beldeu<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Qozog\'istonda ham chang bo\'ronlari, erlarning degradatsiyasi va cho\'llanishga muvofiqlashtirilgan javob sifatida xizmat qiluvchi mintaqaviy o\'lchovga ega bo\'ldi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Birgalikda ushbu va boshqa tashabbuslar mintaqaviy kun tartibini ekologik muammolarni muhokama qilishdan texnologiya, moliyalashtirish va xalqaro ekspertizalarni jalb qilish bo\'yicha amaliy chora-tadbirlarni muvofiqlashtirishga bosqichma-bosqich o\'zgartirdi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shu bilan birga, Markaziy Osiyo davlatlari qayta tiklanadigan energiya manbalari boÔÇİyicha yirik loyihalarni parallel ravishda amalga oshirishni boshladilar, ular toza energiyani ekotizimlarga bosimni kamaytirish va issiqlik energiyasini ishlab chiqarishga bogÔÇİliqlikni kamaytirishning muhim vositasi sifatida koÔÇİrishdi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Markaziy Osiyo delegatsiyalarining Birlashgan Millatlar Tashkilotining Iqlim o\'zgarishi bo\'yicha konferentsiyalarida (COP) tobora ko\'proq muvofiqlashtirilgan ishtiroki mintaqani global iqlim boshqaruvida tobora ta\'sirchan ovozga aylantirdi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ehtimol, eng muhim yutuq umumiy tabiiy resurslarga o\'nlab yillar davomida ishonchsizlikni engib o\'tishdir<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">bizning. Mintaqaviy hamkorlikning o\'ziga xos doirasi vujudga keldi, unda ekologik hamkorlik yumshoq kuch shakliga aylandi, Markaziy Osiyoning beshta davlatini umumiy maqsad atrofida birlashtirdi: kelajak avlodlar uchun umumiy muhitni saqlab qolish.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>Global qayta o\'rnatish va kelajak ufqlari<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Markaziy Osiyo endilikda qaytadan o\'tish bilan tavsiflangan yangi bosqichga kirdi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">global ekologik kun tartibiga chuqurroq integratsiya qilish uchun mintaqaviy konsolidatsiya. Iqlimni boshqarishda global o\'zgarishlar yangi qoidalarni o\'rnatmoqda, bunda iqlimga chidamlilik tabiiy resurslar yoki tranzit salohiyati kabi qimmatli strategik aktivga aylanmoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Mintaqada yangi muammolar ham paydo bo\'ldi, xususan, turmush darajasining ko\'tarilishining ekologik xarajatlari bilan bog\'liq. Tez motorizatsiya, issiqlik elektr stantsiyalarining eng yuqori quvvatda ishlashi va kengaytirish<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">peri<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">-shahar qishloq xo\'jaligi ishlab chiqarishi havo sifatini sezilarli darajada yomonlashtirdi va tumanning eng yirik shaharlari uchun tutunni aholi salomatligi uchun jiddiy tashvishga aylantirdi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bu muammolarni hal qilish ifloslanishni nazorat qiluvchi uskunalarni o\'rnatishdan ko\'ra ko\'proq narsani talab qiladi. Bu milliy chegaralar orqali suv, energetika va oziq-ovqat sektorlari o\'rtasida yaqin muvofiqlashtirishga asoslangan integratsiyalashgan mintaqaviy yondashuvni talab qiladi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shu nuqtai nazardan, kelgusi yillar Markaziy Osiyoning mustaqil va nufuzli ishtirokchi sifatidagi mavqeini mustahkamlashda hal qiluvchi ahamiyatga ega boÔÇİladi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">rivojlanmoqda<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">global iqlim arxitekturasi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bu jarayonning muhim bosqichi Ostonada bo╩╗lib o╩╗tgan Mintaqaviy ekologik sammitdir. Sammit nafaqat so\'nggi o\'n yil ichida erishilgan yutuqlarni baholash, balki<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">shuningdek, mintaqa bo\'ylab texnologik modernizatsiya bo\'yicha uzoq muddatli yo\'l xaritasini ishlab chiqish. U Markaziy Osiyo iqlim jamgÔÇİarmasining operatsion asoslarini institutsionallashtirish, ekologik tashabbuslarni hayotiy investitsiya loyihalariga aylantirish kutilmoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Kelajakda mintaqaviy ekologik kun tartibi uchta strategik ustuvorlik atrofida aylanishi mumkin.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Birinchidan, texnologik suverenitet.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Markaziy Osiyo atrof-muhitni muhofaza qilish texnologiyalarini import qilishdan tashqari, o\'z yechimlarini ishlab chiqish va mahalliylashtirish, jumladan, issiqlik elektr stansiyalari uchun suvni boshqarishning aqlli tizimlari va raqamli chiqindilarni monitoring qilish yo\'lida tobora ko\'proq harakat qiladi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ikkinchidan, iqtisodiyotni yashillashtirish.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ESG standartlari milliy kompaniyalar faoliyatiga bosqichma-bosqich integratsiyalashuvi kutilmoqda, bu esa xalqaro bozorlarning kengaytirilayotgan uglerodni tartibga solish mexanizmlari ostida eksport raqobatbardoshligini saqlab, yashil moliyalashtirishdan foydalanishni yaxshilash imkonini beradi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Uchinchidan, siyosatni muvofiqlashtirish.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Kelgusi COP konferentsiyalarida yaxlit mintaqaviy iqlim bloki sifatida harakat qilish Markaziy Osiyo mamlakatlariga o\'zlarining umumiy manfaatlarini, xususan iqlimga moslashish tashabbuslarini xalqaro qo\'llab-quvvatlash borasida yanada samaraliroq himoya qilish imkonini beradi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>Xulosa<\\/i><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Markaziy Osiyoda ekologik siyosat asosan gumanitar g\'amxo\'rlikdan mintaqaviy rivojlanishning strategik tayanchiga aylandi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;border-left:none;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Buni viloyat tajribasi koÔÇİrsatadi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">transchegaraviy<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ekologik muammolarni raqobat orqali emas, balki hamkorlik va sinergiya orqali hal qilish yaxshidir. Bu yondashuv Markaziy Osiyoning hech qanday l emasligiga ishonchli dalil beradi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">faqat iqlim xavf-xatarlariga zaif mintaqa sifatida qabul qilinadi. Buning o\'rniga, u kengroq Yevroosiyo mintaqasi uchun namuna bo\'lishi mumkin bo\'lgan barqaror rivojlanishning yangi modeli shakllanayotgan imkoniyatlar maydoni sifatida tobora ko\'proq paydo bo\'lmoqda.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"ru\":\"<p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\" class=\\\"docData;DOC