9BDAEOAQxBD4EOwRMBEgEOAQ5BCAAPQQ1BDgEQQQ\\\\\\\\\\/AQAAAUAAAAAEBg4AAABDAGEAbQBiAHIAaQBhAAUGDgAAAEMAYQBtAGIAcgBpAGEACAQcAAAADQYGAAAANgA5ADkAFgQcAAAACDUBAAAAMAEAACIEMAQ6BDYENQQgAEEEPgRFBEAEMAQ9BE8ENQRCBEEETwQgADIESwRBBD4EOgQ4BDkEIAA\\\\\\/uxwKAAAAAAAAAAARAAAAANgDAAAALQAAAAEGAAAAAAkGGwAAACcEFgEAAAsBARwBACgEAAAAAB0BACkEoAAAABsGAAAAAAFOAAAAKAEHKQEHKgEGKwEFEwEBCAQYAAAAFgQYAAAAGQYKAAAAcgB1AC0AUgBVABoGCgAAAGEAcgAtAFMAQQAbBgoAAAByAHUALQBSAFUALgEDAk4DAAAA\\\\/\\/\\/\\/xkBARsGmwAAAAAaAAAAAAMAAAAFBAAAAAAGBAQAAAADAf8HBP\\/\\/\\/\\/8BGgAAAAADAAAABQQAAAAABgQEAAAAAwH\\/BwT\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/AhoAAAAAAwAAAAUEAAAAAAYEBAAAAAMB\\/wcE\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/wMaAAAAAAMAAAAFBAAAAAAGBAQAAAADAf8HBP\\/\\/\\/\\/8LGgAAAAADAAAABQQAAAAABgQEAAAAAwH\\/BwT\\/\\/\\/\\/\\\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Raqamli texnologiyalar,<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">sanoat<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bu hamkorlik, ÔÇ£yashilÔÇØ energiya va inson kapitali Markaziy Osiyo va Germaniya o╩╗rtasidagi hamkorlikning yangi harakatlantiruvchi kuchi sifatida ko╩╗rilmoqda. Bu haqda Xiva shahrida boÔÇİlib oÔÇİtgan ekspertlar forumida soÔÇİz bordi. Gazeta tashqi siyosatni oÔÇİrganish markazi xodimi bilan suhbatlashdi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">sent<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Markaziy Osiyo va Germaniya hamkorlikni faollashtirish uchun yangi tarmoqlarni izlamoqda: raqamli texnologiyalardan tortib, inson kapitalini rivojlantirishgacha. 16-17 aprel kunlari Xivada boÔÇİlib oÔÇİtgan ÔÇ£Markaziy Osiyo ÔÇô GermaniyaÔÇØ birinchi ekspert forumida shular haqida soÔÇİz bordi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Tadbir OÔÇİzbekiston Prezidenti huzuridagi Strategik va mintaqalararo tadqiqotlar instituti, Adenauer nomidagi jamgÔÇİarma va fond hamkorligida tashkil etildi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ebert<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Gazeta Daria bilan suhbatlashdi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Gorelkina<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, Tashqi siyosiy tadqiqotlar markazining bosh ilmiy xodimi, kelgusi yillarda o\'zaro munosabatlar qanday yo\'nalishlarda shakllantirilishi haqida.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>ÔÇö Markaziy Osiyo mamlakatlari va Germaniya o╩╗rtasidagi siyosiy muloqotning qaysi asosiy yo╩╗nalishlari, sizningcha, o╩╗rta muddatli istiqbolda ustuvor yo╩╗nalishlarga aylanishi kerak? Bu alohida tanlovning sababi nimada? (3 shardan ko\'p bo\'lmagan)<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">O\'rta muddatli istiqbolda uchta ustuvor yo\'nalishni belgilash mumkin.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Birinchidan, bu<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">mintaqa mamlakatlarida institutsional rivojlanish jarayonlarini qo\'llab-quvvatlash.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Germaniya oÔÇİnlab yillar davomida davlat boshqaruvi uchun ekspert vakolatlarini uzatish va xalqaro huquqiy standartlarni joriy etish boÔÇİyicha maslahat yordamini koÔÇİrsatuvchi tizimli hamkor boÔÇİlib kelgan.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Idoralararo intensiv muloqot<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shuningdek<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">yaratilgan<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">yo\'q<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">uchun barqaror asos<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">hamkorlik kun tartibining barcha masalalari boÔÇİyicha munosabatlarni rivojlantirish va birgalikdagi harakatlarni amalga oshirish<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ikkinchidan, iqtisodiy va texnologik hamkorlik. Germaniya va Markaziy Osiyo mamlakatlari o╩╗rtasidagi umumiy tovar ayirboshlash hajmi qariyb 11 milliard yevroga yetdi, bu 2017-yilga nisbatan 3 baravar ko╩╗p. Shu bilan birga, Germaniya asosiy o╩╗rinlarda turadi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">x mintaqaning Yevropa Ittifoqidagi savdo-iqtisodiy hamkorlari, Germaniya kapitali ishtirokidagi korxonalar soni esa 1300 dan oshadi. Masalan, O╩╗zbekistonda to╩╗plangan nemis investitsiyalari sanoat, energetika va infratuzilmaga e╩╝tibor qaratgan holda 1ÔÇô1,5 milliard dollarga yaqinlashmoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ushbu ko\'rsatkichlar o\'zaro iqtisodiy ishtirokning barqaror o\'sib borayotganini aks ettiradi va hamkorlikning yanada murakkab formatlariga o\'tish uchun asos yaratadi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">-<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">sanoat kooperatsiyasi, ishlab chiqarishni mahalliylashtirish, ÔÇ£yashilÔÇØ energetika va transport aloqasini rivojlantirish.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Uchinchidan, rivojlanish<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ko\'p tomonlama o\'zaro ta\'sir. Xalqaro tizimni oÔÇİzgartirish sharoitida strategik yondashuvlarni muvofiqlashtirish va hamkorlikning amaliyotga yoÔÇİnaltirilgan formatlariga, jumladan, xalqaro tashkilotlardagi pozitsiyalarni muvofiqlashtirishga oÔÇİtishning ahamiyati ortib bormoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>ÔÇö Bugun xalqaro kun tartibidagi qaysi masalalarda Markaziy Osiyo davlatlari va Germaniyaning pozitsiyalari bir-biriga mos keladi? Qaysi masalalarda kelishmovchiliklar saqlanib qolmoqda?<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ko\'pchilik tomonidan<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">savollar<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">global kun tartibi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">yondashuvlar<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">mamlakatlarimiz juda yaqin. Biz tamoyillarga birdek sodiqmiz<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ko\'p tomonlama<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">iqlim o\'zgarishi kabi global muammolarni hal qilishda<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Va<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">\\\"yashil\\\"<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">transformatsiya<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Iqtisodiy sohada Markaziy Osiyo<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">va Germaniya transport koridorlarini rivojlantirishdan manfaatdor<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, ishlab chiqarish uchun<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">tanqidiy ahamiyatga ega<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">materiallar, sanoat va axborot texnologiyalarini rivojlantirish.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Qarama-qarshiliklar<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">asosan Yevropaning yetakchi davlati, NATO va YeI a╩╝zosi bo╩╗lgan Germaniyaning o╩╗ziga xos xususiyatlari, shuningdek, uning iqtisodiy rivojlanishining eng yuqori darajasi bilan bog╩╗liq.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Mintaqamiz rivojlanmoqda va shuning uchun turli qarashlar paydo bo\'lmoqda<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Kasat<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">haqiqatan ham<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, birinchi navbatda, sur\'at<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">energiya almashinuvi,<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">geoiqtisodiy siyosatning xususiyatlari va sanksiya rejimlariga yondashuvlar. Biroq<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">bunday farqlar<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">cheklangan xarakterga ega va strategik muloqotga toÔÇİsqinlik qilmaydi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>ÔÇö Sizningcha, Markaziy Osiyo mamlakatlari Germaniya va butun Yevropadan sarmoyalarni jalb qilishda umumiy, muvofiqlashtirilgan yondashuvni ishlab chiqishlari kerakmi? Bu qanday foyda keltirishi mumkin?<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ha<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, shakllanishi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">birlashtirilgan mintaqaviy yondashuv Markaziy Osiyoning global miqyosda investitsiya jozibadorligini oshirish katalizatori bo\'lishi mumkin.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Mintaqadagi davlatlar potentsiallarining sinergiyasi miqyosning kumulyativ ta\'sirini yaratib, uni nemis biznesi uchun strategik manfaatdor bo\'lgan keng va shaffof bozorga aylantiradi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shu bilan birga, to<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">makroiqtisodiy siyosatni muvofiqlashtirish imkonini beradi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">kamaytirish<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">xavflar,<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">kamaytirish<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">kirish to\'siqlari va tartibga solish shartlarining uzluksizligini ta\'minlash.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bu, ayniqsa, uchun to\'g\'ri keladi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">kapital talab qiluvchi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">transchegaraviy hamkorlik va muhim sarmoya resurslarini talab qiluvchi infratuzilma va energetika loyihalari.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Amalga oshirish<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ushbu o\'zaro ta\'sir modeli uzoq muddatli texnologik hamkorlik uchun asos yaratadi va etakchi kompaniyalar mavjudligini sezilarli darajada kengaytiradi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Germaniyada<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">mintaqa<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">e<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>ÔÇö Nemis investorlarining milliy yoki mintaqaviy miqyosdagi ustuvor yoÔÇİnalishlari tahlil qilinganmi? Ularning manfaatlari mintaqa davlatlarining ustuvorliklari bilan qay darajada mos keladi?<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Tahlil amalga oshiriladi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ham vakolatli organlardan, ham tadbirkorlik jamiyatining oÔÇİzidan. Quvonarlisi, keyingi yillarda jamiyat<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">tadbirkorlar mutasaddi idoralar bilan faol muloqot olib boradi, shart-sharoitlarni yaxshilash boÔÇİyicha oÔÇİz takliflarini bildiradi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Nemis sarmoyadorlari sanoat, energetika, transport va logistika, shuningdek, ekologik toza texnologiyalarni joriy etishga e╩╝tibor qaratmoqda. Xususan, Germaniya qayta tiklanadigan energiya va energiya samaradorligi sohasidagi loyihalarni faol ilgari surmoqda.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bu hududlar mintaqa davlatlarining strategik maqsadlariga toÔÇİliq mos keladi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Xuddi o\'sha payt<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">muammoli holatlar mavjud<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">institutsional muhit, investitsiyalarni himoya qilish va tartibga soluvchi prognozlar bilan bog\'liq masalalar.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ularni chuqur oÔÇİrganish asosida jadallashtirish chora-tadbirlari izchil amalga oshirilmoqda<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">sarmoya<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">hamkorlik.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>ÔÇö Germaniya va Markaziy Osiyo mamlakatlari oÔÇİrtasidagi hamkorlikning qaysi sohalari bugungi kunda eng katta foydalanilmagan salohiyat boÔÇİlib qolmoqda?<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Eng muhim potentsial bir necha o\'zaro bog\'liq sohalarda qolmoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Avvalo, bu raqamli texnologiyalar, jumladan, sun\'iy intellekt bo\'lib, qo\'shma texnologik platformalarni shakllantirish mumkin.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ikkinchi yo\'nalish<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">-<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">sanoat kooperatsiyasi. Germaniyada energiya narxining yuqoriligi ishlab chiqarishni xorijda, jumladan, Markaziy Osiyoda joylashtirishga qiziqish uygÔÇİotmoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Uchinchi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">-<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">inson kapitali. Germaniyada ishchi kuchi taqchilligi va Markaziy Osiyo aholisi dunyodagi eng yosh aholidan biri ekanligi fonida bir-birini to\'ldiruvchi model paydo bo\'lmoqda: mintaqa mehnat resurslari manbai sifatida, Germaniya esa<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">-<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ta\'lim va texnologiya yechimlari provayderi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Iqlim, suv va energiya chorrahasida joylashgan hududlarda ham integratsiyalashgan mintaqaviy yondashuv zarur bo\'lgan yuqori salohiyat saqlanib qolmoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;border-left:none;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Nihoyat, muhim imkoniyatlar savdoni rivojlantirish, transport aloqasi va yuqori qo\'shimcha qiymatga ega bo\'lgan hududiy ishlab chiqarish zanjirlarini shakllantirish bilan bog\'liq.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"ru\":\"<p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\" class=\\\"docData;DOCY;v5;38681;\\\\/BEAEOARPBEIEOAQ1BCAAMQRLBDsEPgQgAD4EQAQzBDAEPQQ4BDcEPgQyBDAEPQQ+BCAAGAQ9BEEEQgQ4BEIEQwRCBD4EPAQgAEEEQgRABDAEQgQ1BDMEOARHBDUEQQQ6BDgERQQgADgEIAA8BDUENgRABDUEMwQ4BD4EPQQwBDsETAQ9BEsERQQgADgEQQRBBDsENQQ0BD4EMgQwBD0EOAQ5BCAAPwRABDgEIAA\\\\\\\\/BDUEQAQyBEsERQQsACAATQRCBD4EIAAF1QAAAAFAAAAABAYOAAAAQwBhAG0AYgByAGkAYQAFBg4AAABDAGEAbQBiAHIAaQBhAAgEHAAAAA0GBgAAADYAOQA5ABYEHAAAAAiLAAAAAIYAAAA\\\\\\\\\\/wEAAAD6AQAAEgQ+BC0AMgRCBD4EQARLBEUELAAgAE0EOgQ+BD0EPgQ8BDgERwQ1BEEEOgQwBE8EIAA4BCAAQgQ1BEUEPQQ+BDsEPgQzBDgERwQ1BEEEOgQwBE8EIAA6BD4EPgQ\\/BDUEQAQwBEYEOARPBC4AIAAhBD4EMgQ+BDoEQwQ\\/BD0ESwQ5BCAAQgQ+BDIEMARABD4EPgQxBD4EQAQ+BEIEIAA8BDUENgQ0BEMEIAATBDUEQAQ8BDAEPQQ4BDUEOQQgADgEIABBBEIEQAQwBD0EMAQ8BDgEIAAmBDUEPQRCBEAEMAQ7BEwEPQQ+BDkEIAAQBDcEOAQ4BCAANAQ+BEEEQgQ4BDMEIAA\\\\/BDAEQARCBD0EUQRABD4EMgQgAEAENQQzBDgEPgQ9BDAEIAAyBCAAFQQhBCwAIAAwBCAARwQ4BE