BEEETwQgADIESwRBBD4EOgQ4BDkEIAA\\\\\\/uxwKAAAAAAAAAAARAAAAANgDAAAALQAAAAEGAAAAAAkGGwAAACcEFgEAAAsBARwBACgEAAAAAB0BACkEoAAAABsGAAAAAAFOAAAAKAEHKQEHKgEGKwEFEwEBCAQYAAAAFgQYAAAAGQYKAAAAcgB1AC0AUgBVABoGCgAAAGEAcgAtAFMAQQAbBgoAAAByAHUALQBSAFUALgEDAk4DAAAA\\\\/\\/\\/\\/xkBARsGmwAAAAAaAAAAAAMAAAAFBAAAAAAGBAQAAAADAf8HBP\\/\\/\\/\\/8BGgAAAAADAAAABQQAAAAABgQEAAAAAwH\\/BwT\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/AhoAAAAAAwAAAAUEAAAAAAYEBAAAAAMB\\/wcE\\/\\/\\/\\/\\/wMaAAAAAAMAAAAFBAAAAAAGBAQAAAADAf8HBP\\/\\/\\/\\/8LGgAAAAADAAAABQQAAAAABgQEAAAAAwH\\/BwT\\/\\/\\/\\/\\\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Digital technologies,<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">industrial<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">This cooperation, ÔÇ£greenÔÇØ energy and human capital are considered as new drivers of cooperation between Central Asia and Germany. This was discussed at the expert forum in Khiva. Gazeta spoke with an employee of the Center for Foreign Policy Research.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Cent<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Central Asia and Germany are looking for new sectors to intensify cooperation: from digital technologies to human capital development. This was discussed during the first expert forum ÔÇ£Central Asia - GermanyÔÇØ, which took place in Khiva on April 16-17.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">The event was organized by the Institute for Strategic and Interregional Studies under the President of Uzbekistan jointly with the Adenauer Foundation and the Foundation<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ebert<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Gazeta talked to Daria<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Gorelkina<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, chief research fellow at the Center for Foreign Policy Research, on what directions will shape interaction in the coming years.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>ÔÇö What key areas of political dialogue between the countries of Central Asia and Germany, in your opinion, should become priorities in the medium term? What is the reason for this particular choice? (no more than 3 spheres)<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">In the medium term, three priority areas can be identified.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Firstly, this<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">support for institutional development processes in the countries of the region.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">For decades, Germany has been a systemic partner, providing the transfer of expert competencies for public administration and providing advisory support on the implementation of international legal standards.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Intensive interdepartmental dialogue<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Also<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">created<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">no<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">stable base for<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">development of relations and joint actions on all issues of the cooperation agenda<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Secondly, economic and technological cooperation. The total trade turnover between Germany and the countries of Central Asia reached about 11 billion euros, more than tripling compared to 2017. At the same time, Germany is among the key<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">x trade and economic partners of the region in the EU, and the number of enterprises with German capital exceeds 1300. In Uzbekistan, for example, accumulated German investments are approaching $1ÔÇô1.5 billion, with an emphasis on industry, energy and infrastructure.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">These indicators reflect the steady growth of mutual economic involvement and form the basis for the transition to more complex formats of cooperation<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ÔÇô<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">industrial cooperation, localization of production, development of ÔÇ£greenÔÇØ energy and transport connectivity.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Thirdly, development<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">multilateral interaction. In the context of the transformation of the international system, the importance of coordinating strategic approaches and moving to practice-oriented formats of cooperation, including coordination of positions in international organizations, is increasing.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>ÔÇö On what issues on the international agenda do the positions of the countries of Central Asia and Germany coincide today? On what issues do differences persist?<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">By majority<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">questions<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">global agenda<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">approaches<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">our countries are very close. We are equally committed to the principles<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">multilateralism<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">in solving global problems such as climate change<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">And<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">\\\"green\\\"<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">transformation<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">&nbsp;<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">In the economic sphere, Central Asia<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">and Germany are interested in developing transport corridors<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, production to<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">critically important<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">materials, development of industrial and information technologies.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Discrepancies<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">are associated mainly with the specifics of Germany - a leading European power, a member of NATO and the EU, as well as the highest level of its economic development.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Our region is still developing and therefore different visions are emerging<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Kasat<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">really<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, first of all, the pace<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">energy transformation,<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">features of geo-economic policy and approaches to sanctions regimes. However<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">such differences<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">are limited in nature and do not impede strategic dialogue.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>ÔÇö Do you think that the countries of Central Asia need to develop a common, coordinated approach to attracting investments from Germany and Europe as a whole? What benefits can this provide?<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Yes<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, formation<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">a consolidated regional approach can act as a catalyst for increasing the investment attractiveness of Central Asia on the global stage.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">The synergy of potentials of the states in the region creates a cumulative effect of scale, transforming it into a capacious and transparent market of strategic interest for German business.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">At the same time, to<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">coordination of macroeconomic policies allows<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">reduce<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">risks,<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">reduce<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">entry barriers and ensure continuity of regulatory conditions.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">This is especially true for<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">capital intensive<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">infrastructure and energy projects that require cross-border cooperation and significant investment resources.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Implementation<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">This interaction model will lay the foundation for long-term technology partnerships and a significant expansion of the presence of leading companies<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">in Germany<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">region<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">e<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>ÔÇö Is there an analysis of the priorities of German investors at the national or regional levels? To what extent do their interests coincide with the priorities of the countries in the region?<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">The analysis is carried out<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">both from the authorized bodies and the business community itself. It is gratifying that in recent years the community<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">entrepreneurs conduct an active dialogue with the authorities, making their proposals on how to improve conditions.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">German investors are focused on industry, energy, transport and logistics, as well as the introduction of environmentally friendly technologies. In particular, Germany is actively promoting projects in the field of renewable energy and energy efficiency.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">These areas fully correspond to the strategic objectives of the countries of the region.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">At the same time<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">there are problematic<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">issues related to the institutional environment, investment protection and regulatory predictability.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Based on their in-depth study, measures are consistently taken to accelerate<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">investment<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">cooperation.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>ÔÇö In which areas of cooperation between Germany and the countries of Central Asia remains the greatest untapped potential today?<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">The most significant potential remains in several interrelated areas.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">First of all, these are digital technologies, including artificial intelligence, where the formation of joint technological platforms is possible.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Second direction<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ÔÇô<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">industrial cooperation. The high cost of energy in Germany stimulates interest in locating production abroad, including in Central Asia.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Third<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ÔÇô<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">human capital. Against the backdrop of a labor shortage in Germany and the fact that the population of Central Asia is one of the youngest in the world, a complementary model is emerging: the region acts as a source of labor resources, and Germany<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ÔÇô<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">provider of educational and technology solutions.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">There also remains high potential in areas at the intersection of climate, water and energy, where an integrated regional approach is needed.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;border-left:none;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Finally, significant opportunities are associated with the development of trade, transport connectivity and the formation of regional production chains with high added value.<\\/span><\\/p>\"}',21,'{\"uz\":\"Germaniya-Markaziy Osiyo: raqamli hamkorlik\",\"ru\":\"ºôºÁªÇº╝º░º¢º©ªÅ-ºĞºÁº¢ªéªÇº░º╗ªîº¢º░ªÅ ºÉºÀº©ªÅ: ªåº©ªäªÇº¥º▓º¥ºÁ ªüº¥ªéªÇªâº┤º¢º©ªçºÁªüªéº▓º¥\",\"en\":\"Germany-Central Asia: digital cooperation\"}');
INSERT INTO `publications` (`id`, `title`, `type`, `category`, `region`, `author`, `year`, `status`, `cover`, `pdf`, `descr`, `seq`, `short_title`) VALUES ('ms2vgfbxszi6','{\"uz\":\"Raqamli texnologiyalar va sanoat kooperatsiyasi Germaniya-Markaziy Osiyo hamkorligining yangi haydovchilariga aylanishi mumkin\",\"ru\":\"ºĞº©ªäªÇº¥º▓ªïºÁ ªéºÁªàº¢º¥º╗º¥º│º©º© º© º┐ªÇº¥º╝ªïªêº╗ºÁº¢º¢º¥ºÁ ªüº¥ªéªÇªâº┤º¢º©ªçºÁªüªéº▓º¥ º╝º¥º│ªâªé ªüªéº░ªéªî º¢º¥º▓ªïº╝º© º┤ªÇº░º╣º▓ºÁªÇº░º╝º© ªüº¥ªéªÇªâº┤º¢º©ªçºÁªüªéº▓º░ ºôºÁªÇº╝º░º¢º©º© º© ºĞºÁº¢ªéªÇº░º╗ªîº¢º¥º╣ ºÉºÀº©º©\",\"en\":\"Digital Technologies and Industrial Cooperation Can Become New Drivers of GermanyÔÇôCentral Asia Cooperation\"}','Monografiya','Tashqi siyosat','Markaziy Osiyo','','2026','published','uploads/img_20260727_085220_50d7d42b.jpg','uploads/doc_20260728_064900_21ee2f63.docx','{\"uz\":\"<p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\" class=\\\"docData;DOCY;v5;31821;\\\\\\\\\\\\/ACAAVwBoAGEAdAAgAGEAZAB2AGEAbgB0AGEAZwBlAHMAIABjAG8AdQBsAGQAIAB0AGgAaQBzACAAcAByAG8AdgBpAGQAZQA\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Raqamli<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">l texnologiyalar, sanoat kooperatsiyasi, yashil energiya va inson kapitali Markaziy Osiyo va Germaniya o╩╗rtasidagi hamkorlikning yangi harakatlantiruvchi kuchi sifatida namoyon bo╩╗lmoqda. Bu masalalar ÔÇ£Markaziy Osiyo ÔÇô GermaniyaÔÇØ birinchi ekspertlar forumida muhokama qilindi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Xiva<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">16-17 aprel.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Tadbir OÔÇİzbekiston Respublikasi Prezidenti huzuridagi Strategik va mintaqaviy tadqiqotlar instituti hamkorligida tashkil etildi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Konrad<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Adenauer jamg\'armasi va Fridrix Ebert jamg\'armasi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Gazeta<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">uz<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">bilan gaplashdi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>Daria<\\/b><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b> <\\/b><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>Gorelkina<\\/b><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">,<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><i>Tashqi siyosat va xalqaro tashabbuslar markazining bosh ilmiy xodimi<\\/i><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">, kelgusi yillarda Germaniya-Markaziy Osiyo hamkorligini shakllantirishi kutilayotgan asosiy sohalar haqida.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>-<\\/b><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>Markaziy Osiyo va Germaniya o╩╗rtasidagi siyosiy muloqotning qaysi sohalari o╩╗rta muddatli istiqbolda ustuvor yo╩╗nalishlarga aylanishi kerak? Ushbu hududlarni nima muhim qiladi?<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">O\'rta muddatli istiqbolda uchta ustuvor yo\'nalish ajralib turadi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Birinchidan, Markaziy Osiyo mamlakatlari bo\'ylab institutsional rivojlanishni qo\'llab-quvvatlash. O\'nlab yillar davomida Germaniya davlat boshqaruvi va boshqa sohalarda tajriba o\'tkazishga ko\'maklashuvchi izchil strategik hamkor bo\'lib kelgan.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">xalqaro huquqiy standartlarni joriy etishda doimiy maslahat yordami. Hukumatlararo jadal muloqot, shuningdek, ikki tomonlama munosabatlarni kengaytirish va sheriklik kun tartibining toÔÇİliq spektri boÔÇİyicha saÔÇÖy-harakatlarni muvofiqlashtirish uchun mustahkam zamin yaratdi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ikkinchidan, iqtisodiy va texnologik hamkorlik.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Germaniya va Markaziy Osiyo davlatlari o╩╗rtasidagi umumiy savdo hajmi qariyb 11 milliard yevroga yetdi, bu 2017-yilga nisbatan uch baravar ko╩╗p. Germaniya Yevropa Ittifoqining asosiy savdo-iqtisodiy hamkorlaridan biri hisoblanadi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">s mintaqada, Markaziy Osiyoda faoliyat yuritayotgan nemis kapitali ishtirokidagi kompaniyalar soni esa 1300 dan oshadi. Birgina OÔÇİzbekistonda toÔÇİplangan Germaniya sarmoyasi asosan sanoat, energetika va infratuzilmaga jamlangan 1ÔÇô1,5 milliard AQSh dollarini tashkil etadi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bu koÔÇİrsatkichlar iqtisodiy oÔÇİzaro bogÔÇİliqlikning izchil kengayib borayotganini aks ettiradi va hamkorlikning yanada murakkab shakllariga, jumladan, sanoat sherikliklariga oÔÇİtish uchun mustahkam asos yaratadi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ishlab chiqarishni mahalliylashtirish, yashil energiyani rivojlantirish va transport aloqasini yaxshilash.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Uchinchidan, ko\'p tomonlama hamkorlikni mustahkamlash.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Xalqaro tizim chuqur oÔÇİzgarishlarni boshdan kechirar ekan, strategik yondashuvlarni muvofiqlashtirish va hamkorlikning yanada amaliy, natijalarga yoÔÇİnaltirilgan formatlariga, jumladan, xalqaro tashkilotlar doirasida yanada yaqinroq muvofiqlashtirishga oÔÇİtish zarurati ortib bormoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Qaysi xalqaro masalalarda Markaziy Osiyo davlatlari va Germaniyaning pozitsiyalari asosan mos keladi? Farqlar qayerda qoladi?<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ko\'pgina asosiy global muammolar bo\'yicha yondashuvlarimiz juda o\'xshash. Markaziy Osiyo ham, Germaniya ham iqlim oÔÇİzgarishi va yashil oÔÇİtish kabi global muammolarni hal qilishda koÔÇİp tomonlama siyosatga sodiq qoladi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Iqtisodiy jihatdan har ikki tomon ham xalqaro transport yoÔÇİlaklarini rivojlantirish, muhim xomashyodan foydalanishni taÔÇÖminlash, sanoat va raqamli texnologiyalarni rivojlantirishdan manfaatdor.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Qolgan farqlar, birinchi navbatda, Germaniyaning Yevropaning yetakchi iqtisodiyoti va Yevropa Ittifoqi va NATO a╩╝zosi sifatidagi o╩╗ziga xos mavqeidan kelib chiqadi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">l iqtisodiy rivojlanishining yuqori darajadan boshlab. Markaziy Osiyo, aksincha, rivojlanayotgan mintaqa bo\'lib qolmoqda. Natijada, energiyaga o\'tish sur\'atlari, geoiqtisodiy siyosatga yondashuvlar va i.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">xalqaro sanktsiyalar rejimlari.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Biroq, bu farqlar koÔÇİlami jihatidan nisbatan cheklangan va mamlakatlarimiz oÔÇİrtasidagi strategik muloqotga toÔÇİsqinlik qilmaydi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>-<\\/b><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>Sizningcha, Markaziy Osiyo davlatlari Germaniya va Yevropadan investitsiyalarni kengroq jalb qilishda muvofiqlashtirilgan mintaqaviy yondashuvni ishlab chiqishi kerakmi? Bu qanday afzalliklarni berishi mumkin?<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ha. Muvofiqlashtirilgan mintaqaviy investitsiya strategiyasini ishlab chiqish Markaziy Osiyoning investitsion maqsad sifatida jozibadorligini sezilarli darajada oshirishi mumkin.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">O\'zining alohida davlatlarining iqtisodiy salohiyatini birlashtirib, mintaqa yig\'indisini hosil qiladi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">nemis investorlari uchun strategik qiziqish uyg\'otadigan yanada kengroq, shaffofroq bozorga aylanadi. Muvofiqlashtirilgan makroiqtisodiy siyosat, shuningdek, investitsion risklarni kamaytirishga, bozorga kirish to\'siqlarini kamaytirishga va tartibga solishning bashorat qilinishini yaxshilashga yordam beradi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bu, ayniqsa, transchegaraviy hamkorlik va katta uzoq muddatli investitsiyalar zarur bo\'lgan kapitalni ko\'p talab qiladigan infratuzilma va energetika loyihalari uchun juda muhimdir.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bunday yondashuv uzoq muddatli texnologik hamkorlik uchun mustahkam poydevor yaratib, yetakchi nemis kompaniyalarining mintaqadagi ishtirokini sezilarli darajada kengaytiradi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>-<\\/b><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>Nemis investorlarining ustuvorliklari milliy yoki mintaqaviy darajada tahlil qilinyaptimi? Ularning manfaatlari Markaziy Osiyo davlatlarining rivojlanish ustuvorliklari bilan qay darajada mos keladi?<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ha. Bunday tahlillar ham tegishli davlat idoralari tomonidan amalga oshiriladi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">va biznes hamjamiyatining o\'zi tomonidan. Quvonarlisi, tadbirkorlik birlashmalari keyingi yillarda davlat hokimiyati va boshqaruvi organlari bilan konstruktiv muloqotni davom ettirib, sarmoyaviy muhitni yaxshilash boÔÇİyicha amaliy takliflar berib, faollashib bormoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Nemis sarmoyadorlari birinchi navbatda ishlab chiqarish, energetika, transport va logistika, shuningdek, ekologik barqaror texnologiyalarga e\'tibor qaratadi. Germaniya qayta tiklanadigan energiya manbalari va energiya samaradorligi loyihalarini ilgari surishda ayniqsa faol boÔÇİldi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bu ustuvorliklar Markaziy Osiyo davlatlarining uzoq muddatli rivojlanish strategiyalariga chambarchas mos keladi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">At<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shu bilan birga, bir qator muammolar, xususan, institutsional muhit, investitsiyalarni himoya qilish va tartibga soluvchi prognozlilik bilan bog\'liq. Bu masalalarni hal etish, sarmoyaviy hamkorlikni yanada jadallashtirish boÔÇİyicha keng qamrovli ishlar olib borilmoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\">&nbsp;<\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>-<\\/b><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Calibri\';font-size:11pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>Germaniya va Markaziy Osiyo o\'rtasidagi hamkorlikning qaysi sohalari hali ham foydalanilmagan katta salohiyatga ega?<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Eng katta foydalanilmagan potentsial bir-biri bilan chambarchas bog\'liq bo\'lgan bir nechta tarmoqlarda yotadi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Birinchidan, raqamli texnologiyalar, xususan, qo\'shma texnologik platformalar va innovatsion ekotizimlarni yaratish imkoniyatlari mavjud bo\'lgan sun\'iy intellekt.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ikkinchidan, sanoat kooperatsiyasi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Germaniyada energiya narxining oshib borishi ayrim ishlab chiqarish faoliyatini xorijga, jumladan, raqobatbardosh ustunliklari tobora yaqqol namoyon boÔÇİlayotgan Markaziy Osiyoga koÔÇİchirishga qiziqishni oshirmoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Uchinchidan, inson kapitali.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Germaniya malakali ishchi kuchi yetishmasligiga duch kelmoqda, Markaziy Osiyo esa<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">a dunyodagi eng yosh va eng tez o\'sayotgan aholidan biriga ega. Bu bir-birini to\'ldiruvchi hamkorlikni yaratadi: Markaziy Osiyo inson resurslariga hissa qo\'shishi mumkin, Germaniya esa ilg\'or ta\'lim, kasbiy tayyorgarlik va texnologik tajribani taqdim etishi mumkin.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Iqlim siyosati, suv resurslarini boshqarish va energetika chorrahasida ham katta salohiyat mavjud boÔÇİlib, bu yerda integratsiyalashgan mintaqaviy yechimlar zarur.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;border-left:none;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Nihoyat, savdo-sotiqni kengaytirish, transport aloqasini mustahkamlash va yuqori qo\'shimcha qiymat ishlab chiqarishga qodir bo\'lgan mintaqaviy qiymat zanjirlarini rivojlantirishda katta imkoniyatlar saqlanib qolmoqda.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"ru\":\"<p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\" class=\\\"docData;DOCY;v5;31821;\\\\\\\\\\\\/ACAAVwBoAGEAdAAgAGEAZAB2AGEAbgB0AGEAZwBlAHMAIABjAG8AdQBsAGQAIAB0AGgAaQBzACAAcAByAG8AdgBpAGQAZQA\\\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ºĞº©ªäªÇº░<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">l ªéºÁªàº¢º¥º╗º¥º│º©º©, º┐ªÇº¥º╝ªïªêº╗ºÁº¢º¢º¥ºÁ ªüº¥ªéªÇªâº┤º¢º©ªçºÁªüªéº▓º¥, ºÀºÁº╗ºÁº¢º░ªÅ ªıº¢ºÁªÇº│ºÁªéº©º║º░ º© ªçºÁº╗º¥º▓ºÁªçºÁªüº║º©º╣ º║º░º┐º©ªéº░º╗ ªüªéº░º¢º¥º▓ªÅªéªüªÅ º¢º¥º▓ªïº╝º© º┤º▓º©ºÂªâªëº©º╝º© ªüº©º╗º░º╝º© ªüº¥ªéªÇªâº┤º¢º©ªçºÁªüªéº▓º░ º╝ºÁºÂº┤ªâ ºĞºÁº¢ªéªÇº░º╗ªîº¢º¥º╣ ºÉºÀº©ºÁº╣ º© ºôºÁªÇº╝º░º¢º©ºÁº╣. º¡ªéº© º▓º¥º┐ªÇº¥ªüªï º▒ªïº╗º© º▓ ªåºÁº¢ªéªÇºÁ º┤º©ªüº║ªâªüªüº©º╣ º▓ ªàº¥º┤ºÁ ºşºÁªÇº▓º¥º│º¥ ªıº║ªüº┐ºÁªÇªéº¢º¥º│º¥ ªäº¥ªÇªâº╝º░ ┬½ºĞºÁº¢ªéªÇº░º╗ªîº¢º░ªÅ ºÉºÀº©ªÅ ÔÇô ºôºÁªÇº╝º░º¢º©ªÅ┬╗, ªüº¥ªüªéº¥ªÅº▓ªêºÁº│º¥ªüªÅ º▓<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ºÑº©º▓º░<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">16ÔÇô17 º░º┐ªÇºÁº╗ªÅ.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.45pt;text-align:justify;line-height:120%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:non