YEOAROBCAAPAQ1BEUEMAQ9BDgENwQ8BD4EMgQ6ACAANAQyBEMEQQRCBD4EQAQ+BD0EPQQ4BDUEIAA8BDUENgQ\\\\/AQAAAVwAAAAEBg4AAABDAGEAbQBiAHIAaQBhAAUGDgAAAEMAYQBtAGIAcgBpAGEABwYOAAAAQwBhAG0AYgByAGkAYQAGBg4AAABDAGEAbQBiAHIAaQBhAAgEHAAAABYEHAAAAAgZAQAAABQBAAAwBCAAQgQwBDoENgQ1BCAAPwQ7BD4ESQQwBDQEOgQ4BCAANAQ4BDAEOwQ+BDMEMAQgAEEEIAAyBD0ENQRIBD0EOAQ8BDgEIAA\\/BDAEQARCBD0EUQRABDAEPAQ4BCAAFCAgABUEMgRABD4EPwQ1BDkEQQQ6BDgEPAQgAEEEPgROBDcEPgQ8BCwAIAAiBEMEQARGBDgENQQ5BCwAIAAaBDgEQgQwBDUEPAQuACAALQRCBDgEIAA4BD0EQQRCBEAEQwQ8BDUEPQRCBEsEIAA\\\\/BDUEIAA7BD4EMwQ4BEcEPQQ1BDUEIAA9BDUEIAA\\/BD4ENAQ8BDUEPQRPBEIETAQsACAAMAQgADQEPgRBBEIEQAQwBDgEMgQwBEIETAQgAEEEQwRJBDUEQQRCBDIEQwROBEkEQwROBCAAMARABEUEOARCBDUEOgRCBEMEQARDBCAAFCAgAD0EMAQ\\/BEAEOAQ8BDUEQAQsACAARwQ1BEAENQQ3BCAAQAQ1BDMEQwQ7BE8EQAQ9BEsENQQgADoEPgQ9BEEEQwQ7BEwEQgQwBEYEOAQ4BCAAPQQwBCAAQwRABD4EMgQ9BDUEIAA\\/BEAEPgREBDgEOwRMBD0ESwRFBAVrAgAAAVwAAAAEBg4AAABDAGEAbQBiAHIAaQBhAAUGDgAAAEMAYQBtAGIAcgBpAGEABwYOAAAAQwBhAG0AYgByAGkAYQAGBg4AAABDAGEAbQBiAHIAaQBhAAgEHAAAABYEHAAAAAgFAgAAAAACAAAgADIENQQ0BD4EPARBBEIEMgQgADgEIAA6BD4EPgRABDQEOAQ9BDAERgQ4BE4EIABCBEAEMAQ9BEEEPwQ+BEAEQgQ9BD4ELQBCBDAEQAQ4BEQEPQQ+BDkEIAA\\\\\\\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>ÔÇö OÔÇİzbekiston va Gruziya munosabatlarini strategik hamkorlik darajasiga olib chiqdi. Ayting-chi, OÔÇİzbekiston Janubiy Kavkazda qanday strategik manfaatlarni koÔÇİzlaydi? Va qanday rol<\\/b><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b><br>&nbsp;<\\/b><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>Gruziya bu o\'yinda o\'ynay oladimi?<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:34pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ÔÇö Iyul oyidagi tashrif chogÔÇİida Strategik hamkorlik toÔÇİgÔÇİrisidagi deklaratsiyaning imzolanishi buni yanada mustahkamladi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"> <\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">bu allaqachon sodir bo\'lgan<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><br>&nbsp;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">amalda: Janubiy Kavkaz OÔÇİzbekiston uchun ustuvor tashqi iqtisodiy yoÔÇİnalishlardan biriga aylandi. Men bu erdagi strategik manfaatlarimizni bir-biriga bog\'liq uchta vazifaga qisqartirgan bo\'lardim.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Birinchidan, bu transport yo\'nalishlarini diversifikatsiya qilishdir. OÔÇİzbekiston dengizga chiqish imkoniga ega emas, shuning uchun Qora dengiz portlariga va undan keyin Yevropa Ittifoqi bozorlariga barqaror kirish imkoniyatiga ega.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><br>&nbsp;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Turkiya esa biz uchun asosiy ahamiyatga ega. Biz har qanday tranzit yoÔÇİnalishiga qaramlikni kamaytirish haqida ketyapmiz<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><br>&nbsp;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">va yangi Yevroosiyo logistika zanjirlariga periferik bo\'g\'in emas, balki ularning to\'la huquqli ishtirokchisi sifatida integratsiyalashuv haqida.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ikkinchidan, bu munosabatlarni iqtisodiy mazmun bilan to\'ldiradi. Siyosiy muloqot bilan bir qatorda savdo, sarmoyaviy, sanoat kooperatsiyasi, transport-logistika ham birinchi oÔÇİringa chiqmoqda.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">osmon aloqasi. OÔÇİtgan yil oxirida bu koÔÇİrsatkich 270 millionga yaqin boÔÇİlganiga qaramay, tomonlar oÔÇİzaro tovar ayirboshlash hajmini 1 milliard dollarga yetkazishni maqsad qilgani muhim. Bu tizimli ishni talab qiladigan ulkan, ammo real maqsad.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Uchinchidan, bu ishtirok etish orqali OÔÇİzbekistonning tashqi siyosat subyektivligini Markaziy Osiyodan tashqarida kengaytirishdir<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><br>&nbsp;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">mintaqaviy o\'zaro hamkorlik formatlarida.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Gruziyaning ushbu koordinatalar tizimidagi roli juda aniq - bu logistika va tranzit ko\'prigi vazifasidir. Gruziya hududi hamda Poti va Batumi portlari orqali O╩╗zbekiston eksporti O╩╗rta yo╩╗lak doirasidagi quruqlikdan Qora dengiz va Yevropaga yo╩╗l oladi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Poti portida OÔÇİzbekistonning koÔÇİp funksiyali terminali loyihasi allaqachon amalga oshirilayotgani bejiz emas ÔÇô bu tranzit salohiyatini deklaratsiyalar tekisligidan beton infratuzilma tekisligiga oÔÇİtkazishdir.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bundan tashqari, Gruziya biz uchun GÔÇİarb hamkorlari bilan, jumladan, muloqot orqali oÔÇİzaro aloqa qilishimiz uchun qoÔÇİshimcha kanal boÔÇİlib xizmat qiladi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><br>&nbsp;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Yevropa Ittifoqi va Global Gateway tashabbuslari bilan.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>ÔÇö Tashrif yakunlari boÔÇİyicha qanday kelishuvlarni OÔÇİzbekiston-Gruziya munosabatlarini rivojlantirish uchun eng muhim deb hisoblaysiz?<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ÔÇö Tashrifning markaziy natijasi, albatta, Strategik sheriklik o╩╗rnatish to╩╗g╩╗risidagi deklaratsiyaning imzolanishi bo╩╗ldi.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><br>&nbsp;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Bu protokol rasmiyatchiligi emas, balki munosabatlar maqomining sifat jihatidan oÔÇİzgarishi: 23 yil ichida birinchi marta bunday darajadagi davlat tashrifi epizodik oÔÇİzaro hamkorlikdan tomonlarning uzoq muddatli majburiyatlari bilan tizimli sheriklikka oÔÇİtishni mustahkamladi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Biroq, men kelishuvlarning ahamiyatini faqat siyosiy \\\"og\'irligi\\\" bilan baholashdan ehtiyot bo\'lardim.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><br>&nbsp;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Menimcha, o\'rta muddatli istiqbolda eng mazmunli qarorlar tarjima qilinadi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">amaliy darajada rivojlantirish. Bu, birinchi navbatda, Poti va Batumi portlari salohiyatidan samarali foydalanish hamda O╩╗rta koridor yo╩╗nalishlarini rivojlantirish bo╩╗yicha kelishuvning transport-logistika blokidir. Ular hamkorlikning iqtisodiy asosini tashkil qiladi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Imzolangan savdo-iqtisodiy soha, sanoat kooperatsiyasi, farmatsevtika, energetika va raqamli texnologiyalarni qamrab olgan sohaviy hujjatlar toÔÇİplami ham bundan kam ahamiyatga ega.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Raqamli yo\'nalishni alohida qayd etmoqchiman: O\'zbek tilida<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Gruziyaning birinchi raqamli banki allaqachon Kistonda ishlamoqda va Toshkent ÔÇô ÔÇïÔÇïTbilisi ÔÇô Batumi yo╩╗nalishlari bo╩╗yicha mamlakatlar o╩╗rtasida to╩╗g╩╗ridan-to╩╗g╩╗ri reyslar amalga oshirilmoqda. Bu har qanday strategik deklaratsiyalarsiz qog\'ozda qoladigan kundalik o\'zaro hamkorlik infratuzilmasi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Boshqalar bilan<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ushlaydi, eng katta qiymat ÔÇ£strategik asos va aniq tarmoq mexanizmlariÔÇØ kombinatsiyasi bilan ifodalanadi. Deklaratsiya vektorni belgilaydi va qo\'llaniladigan kelishuvlar uni o\'lchanadigan mazmun bilan to\'ldiradi - savdo aylanmasini 1 milliard dollarga etkazish maqsadi bilan.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>ÔÇö Muzokaralar chogÔÇİida Boku-Tbilisi-Kars temir yoÔÇİl koridorini qurilayotgan Xitoy-QirgÔÇİiziston-OÔÇİzbekiston avtomobil yoÔÇİli bilan bogÔÇİlash gÔÇİoyasi muhokama qilindi. Bugungi kunda ushbu g\'oyani amalga oshirishga qanday omillar yordam beradi? Va qanday to\'siqlar yo\'lda bo\'lishi mumkin?<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ÔÇö Boku-Tbilisi-Kars temir yoÔÇİl koridorini qurilayotgan Xitoy-QirgÔÇİiziston-OÔÇİzbekiston avtomobil yoÔÇİli bilan bogÔÇİlash gÔÇİoyasi aniq strategik mantiqqa ega. Essentially, what we\'re talking about is<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><br>&nbsp;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Xitoydan uzluksiz temir yo\'l yo\'nalishini shakllantirish to\'g\'risida<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><br>&nbsp;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">O╩╗rta Osiyo, Kaspiy dengizi va Janubiy Kavkazdan o╩╗tib, shimoliy yo╩╗nalishlarni chetlab o╩╗tib Yevropaga.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Qulay omillar orasida men bir nechtasini ta\'kidlagan bo\'lardim. Birinchidan, amaliy harakat<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Loyiha ode Xitoy - Qirg\'iziston -<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">OÔÇİzbekistonda qurilish ishlari olib borilmoqda: investitsiya shartnomasi 2024-yil dekabrida imzolangan va keng koÔÇİlamli ishlar amalga oshirilmoqda<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><br>&nbsp;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">2025 yildan Qirg╩╗iziston bo╩╗limida joylashtirilgan.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ya\'ni, kelajakdagi koridorning sharqiy \\\"yelkasi\\\" jismoniy xususiyatga ega bo\'ladi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">konturlar emas. Boku shossesi -<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Tbi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">tulki<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ÔÇö Qars, o╩╗z navbatida, allaqachon ishlamoqda va O╩╗rta yo╩╗lakka integratsiyalashgan va O╩╗zbekiston bir necha yil avval u orqali pilot tranzit tashishni amalga oshirgan. Nihoyat, siyosiy irodaning tasodifi bor: manfaat<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><br>&nbsp;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">marshrut bir vaqtning o\'zida Xitoy, Markaziy Osiyo mamlakatlari, Ozarbayjon, Gruziya va Turkiyani namoyish etadi, iyul oyidagi tashrifning o\'zi esa Gruziya yo\'nalishi Toshkent tomonidan tobora ko\'proq e\'tiborga olinayotganini ko\'rsatdi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shu bilan birga, to\'siqlar jiddiy va asosan ob\'ektivdir.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Birinchidan<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">bu Xitoy-Qirg\'iziston-O\'zbekiston avtomagistralining o\'zi infratuzilmaviy va texnik murakkabligi: yo\'nalish o\'nlab tunnel va ko\'priklar bilan baland tog\'lardan o\'tadi,<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><br>&nbsp;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">va qurilish bir necha yil davom etishi kutilmoqda.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Ikkinchisi, yo\'lning turli kengliklari muammosi (Xitoyda 1435 mm va postsovet hududida 1520 mm), bu yuk tashish operatsiyalarini talab qiladi va xarajatlarni oshiradi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Uchinchidan, marshrutning ÔÇ£bogÔÇİlovchiÔÇØ xususiyati: davlat chegarasini har bir kesib oÔÇİtish va har bir yuk tashish, jumladan, Kaspiy dengizi orqali parom oÔÇİtishlari vaqt va xarajatlarni oshiradi. Nihoyat, koridorning tijorat barqarorligi kafolatlanganiga bog\'liq bo\'ladi<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">yuk bazasi va butun uzunligi davomida muvofiqlashtirilgan, raqobatbardosh tarif siyosati.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shoir<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Men bu gÔÇİoyani strategik jihatdan istiqbolli, lekin bosqichma-bosqich, mashaqqatli mehnatni talab qiluvchi deb baholayman. Uni amalga oshirish deklaratsiya masalasi emas, balki infratuzilma jadvallarini sinxronlashtirish, texnik standartlarni birlashtirish va yagona tarif konturini barpo etishdan iborat.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>ÔÇö OÔÇİzbekiston muntazam ravishda transport va logistikaga qiziqish bildiradi<\\/b><\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><b>Markaziy Osiyoni Yevropa bilan Janubiy Kavkaz orqali bogÔÇİlaydigan yirik loyihalar. Sizningcha, ÔÇ£Markaziy Osiyo ÔÇô Janubiy KavkazÔÇØ alohida formatini ishga tushirish zarurati bormi? Yoki mavjud ikki tomonlama va koÔÇİp tomonlama mexanizmlar hozircha yetarlimi?<\\/b><\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">ÔÇ£O╩╗ylaymanki, bunday hamkorlikni institutsionalizatsiya qilish uchun ob╩╝yektiv shart-sharoitlar chindan ham yetib bormoqda.Biz ikki tomonlama alohida qadamlarni emas, balki ikki mintaqa o╩╗rtasidagi barqaror yaqinlashish tendentsiyasini kuzatmoqdamiz: so╩╗nggi oylarda.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Gruziya nafaqat OÔÇİzbekiston, balki QozogÔÇİiston bilan ham strategik sheriklikni rasmiylashtirdi, Tojikiston va QirgÔÇİiziston bilan aloqalarni faollashtirdi. Bu endi individual treklarning yig\'indisi emas, balki umumiy logistika va iqtisodiy mantiqqa ega bo\'lgan aloqalar tizimi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shu bilan birga, men shoshqaloq ijoddan ogohlantirgan bo\'lardim<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">uning mavjudligi haqiqati uchun yana bir byurokratik tuzilmani yaratish. Bugungi kunda o╩╗zaro hamkorlik mexanizmlar kombinatsiyasi asosida to╩╗liq faoliyat ko╩╗rsatmoqda: ikki tomonlama hukumatlararo komissiyalar, O╩╗rta yo╩╗lak va Transkaspiy yo╩╗nalishi formatlari,<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\"><br>&nbsp;<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">shuningdek, tashqi hamkorlar ÔÇô Yevropa Ittifoqi, Turkiya, Xitoy bilan muloqot platformalari. Bu vositalar hali o\'z imkoniyatlarini tugatmagan.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Shuning uchun mening javobim muvozanatli. Hozirgi bosqichda mavjud arxitekturani almashtirish emas, balki to\'ldirish mantiqan to\'g\'ri keladi - masalan, ixtisoslashgan darajadagi muntazam maslahatlashuvlar orqali.<\\/span><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">boshqarmalari va transport va tarif siyosatini muvofiqlashtirish. \\\"Markaziy Osiyo - Janubiy Kavkaz\\\" alohida formati ulanishlarning zichligi va murakkabligi mavjud mexanizmlarning imkoniyatlaridan oshib ketganda va doimiy muvofiqlashtiruvchi sxemani talab qilganda oqlanadi.<\\/span><\\/p><p style=\\\"text-indent:35.400000000000006pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;border-left:none;border-top:none;border-right:none;border-bottom:none;mso-border-between:none\\\"><span style=\\\"font-family:\'Cambria\';font-size:14pt;color:#000000;mso-style-textfill-fill-color:#000000\\\">Mavjud dinamikaga qaraganda, bu lahza yaqinlashmoqda va bunga oldindan tayyorgarlik ko\'rish kerak - lekin masalaga institutlarni ko\'paytirish istagidan emas, balki hamkorlikning haqiqiy mazmunidan boshlab pragmatik yondashish kerak.<\\/span><\\/p>\",\"ru\":\"<p style=\\\"text-indent:34pt;text-align:justify;line-height:114%;margin-top:6.000000000000001pt;margin-bottom:6.000000000000001pt;border:none;mso-border-left-alt:none;mso-border-top-alt:none;mso-border-right-alt:none;mso-border-bottom-alt:none;mso-border-between:none\\\" class=\\\"docData;DOCY;v5;31000;\\\\\\\\/BD4EQARCBD0ESwRFBCAAPAQwBEAESARABEMEQgQ+BDIELgAgACMENwQxBDUEOgQ4BEEEQgQwBD0EIAA9BDUEIAA4BDwENQQ1BEIEIAAyBEsERQQ+BDQEMAQgADoEIAA8BD4EQAROBCwAIAA\\/BD4ETQRCBD4EPARDBCAAPwQ+BDsEQwRHBDUEPQQ4BDUEIABDBEEEQgQ+BDkERwQ4BDIEPgQzBD4EIAA0BD4EQQRCBEMEPwQwBCAAOgQgAEcENQRABD0EPgQ8BD4EQARBBDoEOAQ8BCAAPwQ+BEAEQgQwBDwEIAA4BCAANAQwBDsENQQ1BCAAOgQgAEAESwQ9BDoEMAQ8BCAAFQQyBEAEPgQ\\\\/gAAADgEIAAiBEMEQARGBDgEOAQgADgEPAQ1BDUEQgQgADQEOwRPBCAAPQQwBEEEIAA\\/BEAEOAQ9BEYEOAQ\\\\\\/BDUEQAQyBEsEOQQgAD8EOwQwBD0EIAAyBEsERQQ+BDQETwRCBCAAQgQ+BEAEMwQ+BDIEOwRPBCwAIAA4BD0EMgQ1BEEEQgQ4BEYEOAQ4BCwAIAA\\\\/BD4EQQRCBDAEMgQ4BDsEOAQgADcEMAQ0BDAERwRDBCAANAQ+BDIENQRBBEIEOAQgADIENwQwBDgEPAQ9BEsEOQQgAEIEPgQyBDAEQAQ+BD4EMQQ+BEAEPgRCBCAANAQ+BCAAMQAgADwEOwRABDQEIAA0BD4EOwQ7BDAEQAQ+BDIEIAAUICAAPwRABDgEIABCBD4EPAQsACAARwRCBD4EIAA\\\\\\\\/BD4EQARCBEsEIAAfBD4EQgQ4BCAAOAQgABEEMARCBEMEPAQ4BCAAQwQ3BDEENQQ6BEEEOgQ4BDkEIABNBDoEQQQ\\/BD4EQARCBCAAPwQ+BDsEQwRHBDAEN